"dynamic domain name."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີບເວີຊື່ໂດເມນຮອງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສໍາລັບຊື່ໂດເມນໄດນາມິກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:327
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:405
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:295
msgid "A valid domain key name, algorithm and secret must be specified."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ກະແຈໂດເມນ, ອັນທະລິທຶມ ແລະຄວາມລັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:330
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:408
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:298
msgid ""
"The domain key name may only contain the characters a-z, A-Z, 0-9, '-', '_' "
"and '.'"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ກະແຈໂດເມນອາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ a-z, A-Z, 0-9, '-', '_' ແລະ '.'."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:333
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:411
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:301
msgid "The domain key secret must be a Base64 encoded value."
msgstr "ຄວາມລັບຂອງກະແຈໂດເມນຕ້ອງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ Base64."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:340
#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:167
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:418
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:308
msgid "A valid domain search list must be specified."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍການຄົ້ນຫາໂດເມນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:349
msgid ""
"A valid IPv6 address must be specified for the primary/secondary NTP servers."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສໍາລັບເຊີບເວີ NTP ຫລັກ/ຮອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:352
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:438
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:320
msgid "A valid domain name must be specified for the DNS domain."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສໍາລັບໂດເມນ DNS."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:355
msgid ""
"A valid IPv6 address or hostname must be specified for the TFTP server."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ຫລືຊື່ເຄື່ອງໂດຍຖືກຕ້ອງສໍາລັບເຊີບເວີ TFTP."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:358
msgid "A valid URL must be specified for the network bootfile."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸ URL ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສໍາລັບໄຟລ໌ເລີ່ມລະບົບເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:366
#, php-format
msgid "The subnet range cannot overlap with virtual IPv6 address %s."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງ subnet ບໍ່ສາມາດທັບຊ້ອນກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ສະເໝືອນ %s."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:383
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:510
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The DHCP relay on the %s interface must be disabled before enabling the DHCP "
"server."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ DHCP relay ບນອິນເທີເຟດ %s ກ່ອນຈະເປີດໃຊ້ DHCP server."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:395
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:555
msgid "The specified range lies outside of the current subnet."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ນອກ subnet ປະຈຸບັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:400
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:550
msgid "The range is invalid (first element higher than second element)."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ອົງປະກອບທຳອິດສູງກວ່າອົງປະກອບທີ່ສອງ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:416
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:589
#, php-format
msgid "The DHCP range cannot overlap any static DHCP mappings."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງ DHCP ບໍ່ສາມາດທັບຊ້ອນກັບການກຳນົດ DHCP ແບບຄົງທີ່ໃດໆ."

