#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:735
msgid ""
"Leave blank to use the system default DNS servers, this interface's IP if "
"DNS forwarder is enabled, or the servers configured on the \"General\" page."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຫວ່າງເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີ DNS ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ, IP ຂອງອິນເທີເຟສນີ້ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ DNS forwarder, "
"ຫລືເຊີບເວີທີ່ກຳນົດໃນຫນ້າ \"General\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:743
msgid ""
"Unchecking this box disables the dhcp6.name-servers option. Use with "
"caution, as the resulting behavior may violate RFCs and lead to unintended "
"client behavior."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ເລືອກກ່ອງນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານຂອງ dhcp6.name-servers. "
"ໃຊ້ຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ, ເພາະຜົນກະທົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອາດຈະຂັດກັບ RFCs "
"ແລະນຳໄປສູ່ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລູກຄ້າທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:748
