#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:109
msgid ""
"Subnets are specified in CIDR format.  Select the CIDR mask that pertains to "
"each entry.\t/128 specifies a single IPv6 host; /64 specifies a normal IPv6 "
"network; etc.  If no subnets are specified here, the Router Advertisement "
"(RA) Daemon will advertise to the subnet to which the router's interface is "
"assigned."
msgstr ""
"ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍ (Subnet) ຖືກລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR. ເລືອກ CIDR mask ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການ.\t"
"/128 ກຳນົດເຄື່ອງ IPv6 ຕົວເດີມ; /64 ກຳນົດເປັນເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ປົກກະຕິ; ແລະອື່ນໆ. "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ລະບຸເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍທີ່ນີ້, Router Advertisement (RA) Daemon ຈະໂຄສະນາໃຫ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ອິນເທີເຟສຂອງເສົາກວນຖືກກຳນົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:116
msgid "Select the Operating Mode for the Router Advertisement (RA) Daemon."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂໝດການເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບ Router Advertisement (RA) Daemon."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:119
msgid "RADVD will not be enabled on this interface."
msgstr "RADVD ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນອິນເທີເຟສນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:120
msgid "Router Only"
msgstr "ເພີ່ງແຕ່ເສົາກວນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:120
msgid "Will advertise this router."
msgstr "ຈະໂຄສະນາເສົາກວນນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:121
msgid "Unmanaged"
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄວບຄຸມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:121
msgid "Will advertise this router with stateless autoconfig."
msgstr "ຈະໂຄສະນາເສົາກວນນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດແບບບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:122
msgid "Managed"
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມແລ້ວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:122
msgid "Will advertise this router with all configuration through a DHCPv6 server."
msgstr "ຈະໂຄສະນາເສົາກວນນີ້ພ້ອມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດຜ່ານເຊີເວີ DHCPv6."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:123
msgid "Assisted"
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:123
msgid ""
"Will advertise this router with configuration through a DHCPv6 server and/or "
"stateless autoconfig."
msgstr "ຈະໂຄສະນາເສົາກວນນີ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍ DHCPv6 server ແລະ/ຫລື ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດແບບບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:124
msgid "Stateless DHCP"
msgstr "DHCP ບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:124
msgid ""
"Will advertise this router with stateless autoconfig and other configuration "
"information available via DHCPv6."
msgstr "ຈະໂຄສະນາເສົາກວນນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດແບບບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ ແລະຂໍ້ມູນຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆທີ່ມີຜ່ານ DHCPv6."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:126
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It is not required to activate DHCPv6 server on %s when set to \"Managed\", "
"\"Assisted\" or \"Stateless DHCP\", it can be another host on the network."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ DHCPv6 server ທີ່ %s ເມື່ອຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"Managed\", \"Assisted\" ຫລື \"Stateless DHCP\", ມັນສາມາດເປັນໂຮສອື່ນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "An invalid subnet or alias was specified. [%1$s/%2$s]"
msgstr "ໄດ້ລະບຸເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍ (subnet) ຫລື ຊື່ອື່ນ (alias) ທີ່ຜິດພາດ. [%1$s/%2$s]"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:174
msgid ""
"A valid lifetime below 2 hours will be ignored by clients (RFC 4862 Section "
"5.5.3 point e)"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕໍ່ໄປຕ່ຳກວ່າ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງຈະຖືກລະເລີຍໂດຍລູກຄ້າ (RFC 4862 ມາດຕາ 5.5.3 ຂໍ້ e)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:177
msgid "Valid lifetime must be an integer."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕ້ອງເປັນຈຳນວນເຕັມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:181
msgid "Minimum advertisement interval must be an integer."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໂຄສະນາຕ່ຳສຸດຕ້ອງເປັນຈຳນວນເຕັມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:184
msgid "Minimum advertisement interval must be no less than 3."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໂຄສະນາຕ່ຳສຸດຕ້ອງບໍ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 3."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:187
msgid ""
"Minimum advertisement interval must be no greater than 0.75 * Maximum "
"advertisement interval"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໂຄສະນາຕ່ຳສຸດຕ້ອງບໍ່ເກີນ 0.75 * ຂອບເຂດໂຄສະນາສູງສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:192
msgid "Maximum advertisement interval must be an integer."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໂຄສະນາສູງສຸດຕ້ອງເປັນຈຳນວນເຕັມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:195
msgid ""
"Maximum advertisement interval must be no less than 4 and no greater than "
"1800."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໂຄສະນາສູງສຸດຕ້ອງບໍ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 4 ແລະບໍ່ເກີນ 1800."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:199
msgid "Router lifetime must be an integer between 1 and 9000."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາຂອງເສົາກວນຕ້ອງເປັນຈຳນວນເຕັມລະຫວ່າງ 1 ແລະ 9000."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_router_advertisements.php:206
msgid ""
"Default valid lifetime must be greater than Default preferred lifetime."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕ້ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

