#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_hasync.php:187
msgid "Secondary to Primary node Synchronization"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣນິໄຊການຈາກໂນດຮອງໄປຫາໂນດຫຼັກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_hasync.php:196
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The XMLRPC sync provided by %1$s in <a href=\"/system_hasync.php\">High "
"Availability</a> settings only synchronize a secondary node to its primary "
"node. This checkbox enables a backward sync from the secondary to the primary, "
"in order to have a bi-directional synchronization.%1$sThe purpose of this "
"feature is to keep connected users synchronized between servers even if a "
"node goes down, thus providing redundancy for the captive portal zone."
"%2$s%2$s<b>Important: these settings should be set on the secondary node "
"only! Do not update these settings if this %1$s is the primary node!</b>"
msgstr ""
"ການຊິງ XMLRPC ທີ່ %1$s ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນ <a href=\"/system_hasync.php\">ການມີຢູ່ສູງ</a> "
"ຈະຊິງໂຄຣນິໄຊເທົ່ານັ້ນຈາກໂນດຮອງໄປຫາໂນດຫຼັກ. "
"ຊ່ອງເຊັກນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ສາມາດຊິງກັບຄືນຈາກໂນດຮອງໄປຫາໂນດຫຼັກ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການຊິງໂຄຣນິໄຊສອງທິດ.%1$s"
"ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສາມາດຊິງໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງເຊີບເວີ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໂນດໜຶ່ງຈະຫຼົບລົ້ມ, ຊຶ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພື້ນທີ່ Captive Portal."
"%2$s%2$s<b>ສຳຄັນ: ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂນດຮອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ! "
"ຢ່າປັບປຸງຄ່ານີ້ຖ້າ %1$s ນີ້ເປັນໂນດຫຼັກ!</b>"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_hasync.php:205
#, php-format
msgid "Please fill here the IP address of the primary node.%1$s"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງໂນດຫຼັກທີ່ນີ້.%1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_hasync.php:212
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Please enter the username of the primary node that the secondary node will "
"use for backward sync. This could be any %1$s user on the primary node with "
"\"System - HA node sync\" privileges."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງໂນດຫຼັກ ທີ່ໂນດຮອງຈະໃຊ້ໃນການຊິງກັບຄືນ. "
"ມັນສາມາດເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ %1$s ຄົນໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ໃນໂນດຫຼັກ "
"ທີ່ມີສິດ \"System - HA node sync\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_hasync.php:219
msgid "Please enter the password associated to this user."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໃສ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ຂ້ອງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_hasync.php:231
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It is recommended to configure XMLRPC sync on the primary node before "
"configuring backward synchronization for captive portal."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງ XMLRPC ໃນໂນດຫຼັກກ່ອນ "
"ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງກັບຄືນ ສຳລັບ Captive Portal."

