msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງໃນ GUI. ມັນບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນບັນທຶກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:897
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:902
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:363
msgid "Log Rotation Size (Bytes)"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການໝຸນບັນທຶກ (ໄບດ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:907
msgid ""
"This field controls the size at which logs will be rotated. By default this "
"is %1 per log file.%2$sNOTE: Log file sizes are checked once per minute to "
"determine if rotation is necessary, so a very rapidly growing log file may "
"exceed this value. "
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດທີ່ບັນທຶກຈະຖືກໝຸນວຽນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄື %1 ຕໍ່ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ.%2$sໝາຍເຫດ: "
"ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຈະຖືກກວດສອບທຸກໜຶ່ງນາທີເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໝຸນວຽນຫລືບໍ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ເຕີບໃຫຍ່ຢ່າງໄວອາດຈະເກີນຄ່ານີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:912
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:916
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:380
msgid "Log Retention Count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນບັນທຶກທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:921
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:384
msgid ""
"The number of log files to keep before the oldest copy is removed on "
"rotation."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ສຳເນົາເກົ່າທີ່ສຸດຈະຖືກລຶບໃນຂະນະທີ່ໝຸນວຽນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:924
msgid "Formatted/Raw Display"
msgstr "ສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ/ດິບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:950
msgid ""
"Show the log entries as formatted or raw output as generated by the service. "
"The raw output will reveal more detailed information, but it is more "
"difficult to read."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກໃນຮູບແບບ ຫລື ດິບຕາມທີ່ລະບົບສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຂໍ້ມູນໃນຮູບແບບດິບຈະເປີດເຜີຍລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະອ່ານຍາກຂຶ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:958
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:319
msgid "Web Server Log"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກເວັບເຊີບເວີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:961
msgid ""
"If this is checked, errors from the nginx web server process for the GUI or "
"Captive Portal will appear in the system log."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກຕົວນີ້, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກຂະບວນການເວັບເຊີບເວີ nginx ສໍາລັບ GUI ຫລື Captive Portal "
"ຈະປາກົດໃນບັນທຶກລະບົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:969
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:291
msgid "Log firewall default blocks"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຄໍາສັ່ງປ້ອງກັນໄຟຣ໌ວອນທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:972
msgid ""
"Packets that are blocked by the implicit default block rule will not be "
"logged if this option is unchecked. Per-rule logging options are still "
"respected."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກປ້ອງກັນໂດຍຄຳສັ່ງປ້ອງກັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຝັງຕົວຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກ. "
"ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຂອງແຕ່ລະກົດຍັງຄົງໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຄົາລົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_common.inc:979
msgid ""
"Packets that are allowed by the implicit default pass rule will be logged if "
"this option is checked. Per-rule logging options are still respected."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກອະນຸຍາດໂດຍຄຳສັ່ງຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຝັງຕົວ ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ ຖ້າເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້. "
"ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຂອງແຕ່ລະກົດຍັງຄົງໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຄົາລົບ."

