#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:242
msgid "The DNS forwarder configuration has been changed."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS forwarder ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:247
msgid "General DNS Forwarder Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ DNS Forwarder ທົ່ວໄປ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:261
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set machines that specify their hostname when requesting a "
"DHCP lease will be registered in the DNS forwarder, so that their name can "
"be resolved. The domain in %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s should also be set "
"to the proper value."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, ເຄື່ອງຈັກທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ໂຮສຂອງພວກມັນເມື່ອຮ້ອງຂໍການເຊົ່າ DHCP ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ DNS forwarder, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຊື່ຂອງພວກເຂົາສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ໂດເມນໃນ %1$sລະບົບ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ%2$s ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:273
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set, IPv4 DHCP static mappings will be registered in the "
"DNS forwarder so that their name can be resolved. The domain in %1$sSystem: "
"General Setup%2$s should also be set to the proper value."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, ການສ້າງແຜນທີ່ສະຖິດ IPv4 DHCP ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ DNS forwarder ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຊື່ຂອງພວກເຂົາສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂໄດ້. ໂດເມນໃນ %1$sລະບົບ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ%2$s ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:281
msgid "Prefer DHCP"
msgstr "ມັກ DHCP"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:284
msgid ""
"If this option is set DHCP mappings will be resolved before the manual list "
"of names below. This only affects the name given for a reverse lookup (PTR)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, ການສ້າງແຜນທີ່ DHCP ຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂກ່ອນລາຍຊື່ຊື່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ. ນີ້ມີຜົນກະທົບພຽງແຕ່ຊື່ທີ່ໃຫ້ສໍາລັບການຄົ້ນຫາແບບປີ້ນກັບ (PTR)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:296
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set %1$s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) will query the DNS "
"servers sequentially in the order specified (%2$sSystem - General Setup - "
"DNS Servers%3$s), rather than all at once in parallel. "
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ %1$s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) ຈະສອບຖາມເຊີບເວີ DNS ຕາມລໍາດັບຕາມລໍາດັບທີ່ລະບຸ (%2$sລະບົບ - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ - ເຊີບເວີ DNS%3$s), ແທນທີ່ຈະທັງຫມົດໃນເວລາດຽວກັນຂະຫນານກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:305
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set %s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) will not forward A or AAAA "
"queries for plain names, without dots or domain parts, to upstream name "
"servers.\t If the name is not known from /etc/hosts or DHCP then a \"not "
"found\" answer is returned. "
msgstr "ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ %s ຕົວສົ່ງຕໍ່ DNS (dnsmasq) ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມ A ຫຼື AAAA ສໍາລັບຊື່ທໍາມະດາ, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຈຸດ ຫຼືພາກສ່ວນໂດເມນ, ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງແມ່ຂ່າຍຊື່ຕົ້ນນ້ໍາ.\t ຖ້າຊື່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຈາກ /etc/hosts ຫຼື DHCP ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຄໍາຕອບ \"ບໍ່ພົບ\" ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:314
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set %s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) will not forward reverse "
"DNS lookups (PTR) for private addresses (RFC 1918) to upstream name servers. "
" Any entries in the Domain Overrides section forwarding private \"n.n.n.in-"
"addr.arpa\" names to a specific server are still forwarded. If the IP to "
"name is not known from /etc/hosts, DHCP or a specific domain override then a "
"\"not found\" answer is immediately returned. "
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ %s ຕົວສົ່ງຕໍ່ DNS (dnsmasq) ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ການຊອກຫາ DNS ແບບປີ້ນກັບ (PTR) ສໍາລັບທີ່ຢູ່ສ່ວນຕົວ (RFC 1918) ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງແມ່ຂ່າຍຊື່ຕົ້ນນ້ໍາ. ລາຍການໃດໆໃນພາກສ່ວນການຂຽນທັບໂດເມນທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຊື່ສ່ວນຕົວ \"n.n.n.in-addr.arpa\" ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງແມ່ຂ່າຍສະເພາະຍັງຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ຢູ່. ຖ້າ IP ຫາຊື່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຈາກ /etc/hosts, DHCP ຫຼືການຂຽນທັບໂດເມນສະເພາະໃດນຶ່ງ ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຄໍາຕອບ \"ບໍ່ພົບ\" ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນທັນທີ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:333
#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:552
msgid "*Interfaces"
msgstr "*ອິນເຕີເຟດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:337
msgid ""
"Interface IPs used by the DNS Forwarder for responding to queries from "
"clients. If an interface has both IPv4 and IPv6 IPs, both are used. Queries "
"to other interface IPs not selected below are discarded. The default "
"behavior is to respond to queries on every available IPv4 and IPv6 address."
msgstr ""
"IP ອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ DNS Forwarder ສໍາລັບການຕອບສະຫນອງຕໍ່ຄໍາຖາມຈາກລູກຄ້າ. ຖ້າອິນເຕີເຟດມີທັງ IP IPv4 ແລະ IPv6, ທັງສອງຈະຖືກໃຊ້. ຄໍາຖາມກັບ IP ອິນເຕີເຟດອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ພຶດຕິກໍາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕອບສະຫນອງຕໍ່ຄໍາຖາມໃນທຸກໆທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:342
msgid "Strict binding"
msgstr "ການຜູກມັດທີ່ເຄັ່ງຄັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:345
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the DNS forwarder will only bind to the interfaces "
"containing the IP addresses selected above, rather than binding to all "
"interfaces and discarding queries to other addresses.%1$sThis option does "
"NOT work with IPv6. If set, dnsmasq will not bind to IPv6 addresses."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, DNS forwarder ຈະຜູກມັດກັບອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ເລືອກຂ້າງເທິງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແທນທີ່ຈະຜູກມັດກັບທຸກອິນເຕີເຟດແລະຍົກເລີກຄໍາຖາມກັບທີ່ຢູ່ອື່ນໆ.%1$sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກກັບ IPv6. ຖ້າຕັ້ງ, dnsmasq ຈະບໍ່ຜູກມັດກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6."

