#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_pps.php:176
msgid "Fudge Time"
msgstr "Fudge Time"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_pps.php:179
msgid ""
"Fudge time is used to specify the PPS signal offset from the actual second "
"such as the transmission delay between the transmitter and the receiver "
"(default: 0.0)."
msgstr ""
"Fudge time ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸການຊົດເຊີຍສັນຍານ PPS ຈາກວິນາທີຕົວຈິງ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄວາມຊັກຊ້າໃນການສົ່ງລະຫວ່າງເຄື່ອງສົ່ງແລະເຄື່ອງຮັບ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0.0)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_pps.php:183
#: src/usr/local/www/status_ntpd.php:315
msgid "Stratum"
msgstr "Stratum"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_pps.php:186
msgid ""
"This may be used to change the PPS Clock stratum (default: 0). This may be "
"useful to, for some reason, have ntpd prefer a different clock and just "
"monitor this source."
msgstr ""
"ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ stratum ຂອງໂມງ PPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0). ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດ, ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ ntpd ມັກໂມງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນແລະພຽງແຕ່ຕິດຕາມແຫຼ່ງນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_pps.php:190
#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:400
#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:483
