#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:218
msgid "Cryptographic & Thermal Hardware"
msgstr "ຮາດແວການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະຄວາມຮ້ອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:222
msgid "Cryptographic Hardware"
msgstr "ຮາດແວການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:225
msgid ""
"A cryptographic accelerator module will use hardware support to speed up "
"some cryptographic functions on systems which have the chip. Loading the BSD "
"Crypto Device module will allow access to acceleration devices using drivers "
"built into the kernel, such as Hifn or ubsec chipsets. If the firewall does "
"not contain a crypto chip, this option will have no effect. To unload the "
"selected module, set this option to \"none\" and then reboot."
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນຕົວເລັ່ງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຈະໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບຮາດແວເພື່ອເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວບາງຟັງຊັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີຊິບ. ການໂຫຼດໂມດູນ BSD Crypto Device ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອຸປະກອນເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໂດຍໃຊ້ໄດເວີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ kernel, ເຊັ່ນ: ຊິບເຊັດ Hifn ຫຼື ubsec. ຖ້າໄຟວໍບໍ່ມີຊິບ crypto, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. ເພື່ອຖອນໂຫຼດໂມດູນທີ່ເລືອກ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ \"none\" ແລ້ວຣີບູດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:234
#: src/usr/local/www/widgets/include/thermal_sensors.inc:26
#: src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/thermal_sensors.widget.php:324
msgid "Thermal Sensors"
msgstr "ເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:237
msgid ""
"With a supported CPU, selecting a thermal sensor will load the appropriate "
"driver to read its temperature. Setting this to \"None\" will attempt to "
"read the temperature from an ACPI-compliant motherboard sensor instead, if "
"one is present. If there is not a supported thermal sensor chip in the "
"system, this option will have no effect. To unload the selected module, set "
"this option to \"none\" and then reboot."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍ CPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ການເລືອກເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນຈະໂຫຼດໄດເວີທີ່ເໝາະສົມເພື່ອອ່ານອຸນຫະພູມຂອງມັນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ \"None\" ຈະພະຍາຍາມອ່ານອຸນຫະພູມຈາກເຊັນເຊີເມນບອດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ ACPI ແທນ, ຖ້າມີຢູ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຊິບເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນລະບົບ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. ເພື່ອຖອນໂຫຼດໂມດູນທີ່ເລືອກ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ \"none\" ແລ້ວຣີບູດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:249
msgid "Kernel Page Table Isolation"
msgstr "ການແຍກຕາຕະລາງໜ້າ Kernel"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:252
#: src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/system_information.widget.php:43
#: src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/system_information.widget.php:291
msgid "Kernel PTI"
msgstr "Kernel PTI"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:255
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Meltdown workaround. If disabled the kernel memory can be accessed by "
"unprivileged users on affected CPUs. This option forces the workaround off, "
"and requires a reboot to activate. %1$s%1$sPTI is active by default only on "
"affected CPUs, if PTI is disabled by default then this option will have no "
"effect. %1$sCurrent PTI status: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂ Meltdown. ຖ້າປິດใช้งาน ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ kernel ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດທິພິເສດໃນ CPUs ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປິດການແກ້ໄຂ, ແລະຕ້ອງຣີບູດເພື່ອເປີດใช้งาน. %1$s%1$sPTI ເປີດใช้งานໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະເພາະໃນ CPUs ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ, ຖ້າ PTI ຖືກປິດใช้งานໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. %1$sສະຖານະ PTI ປັດຈຸບັນ: %2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:264
msgid "Microarchitectural Data Sampling Mitigation"
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການເກັບຕົວຢ່າງຂໍ້ມູນ Microarchitectural"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:267
msgid "MDS Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ MDS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:270
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Microarchitectural Data Sampling mitigation. If disabled the kernel memory "
"can be accessed by unprivileged users on affected CPUs. This option controls "
"which method of MDS mitigation is used, if any. %1$s%1$sCurrent MDS status: "
"%2$s"
msgstr ""
"ການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການເກັບຕົວຢ່າງຂໍ້ມູນ Microarchitectural. ຖ້າປິດใช้งาน ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ kernel ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດທິພິເສດໃນ CPUs ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ MDS ທີ່ໃຊ້, ຖ້າມີ. %1$s%1$sສະຖານະ MDS ປັດຈຸບັນ: %2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:276
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_schedule_edit.php:54
#: src/usr/local/www/head.inc:309 src/usr/local/www/firewall_schedule.php:44
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_schedule.php:86
msgid "Schedules"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:280
msgid "Schedule States"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຕາຕະລາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:283
msgid ""
"By default, when a schedule expires, connections permitted by that schedule "
"are killed. This option overrides that behavior by not clearing states for "
"existing connections."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມື່ອຕາຕະລາງໝົດອາຍຸ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໂດຍຕາຕະລາງນັ້ນຈະຖືກຂ້າ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຂຽນທັບພຶດຕິກຳນັ້ນໂດຍການບໍ່ລ້າງສະຖານະສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:288
#: src/usr/local/www/system_gateways_edit.php:197
msgid "Gateway Monitoring"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມ Gateway"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:292
msgid "State Killing on Gateway Failure"
msgstr "ການຂ້າສະຖານະເມື່ອ Gateway ລົ້ມເຫລວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:295
msgid ""
"The monitoring process will flush all states when a gateway goes down if "
"this box is checked."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການຕິດຕາມຈະລ້າງສະຖານະທັງໝົດເມື່ອ gateway ດັບລົງ ຖ້າກ່ອງນີ້ຖືກໝາຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:300
msgid "Skip rules when gateway is down"
msgstr "ຂ້າມກົດລະບຽບເມື່ອ gateway ດັບລົງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:303
msgid ""
"By default, when a rule has a gateway specified and this gateway is down, "
"the rule is created omitting the gateway. This option overrides that "
"behavior by omitting the entire rule instead."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມື່ອກົດລະບຽບມີ gateway ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ ແລະ gateway ນີ້ດັບລົງ, ກົດລະບຽບຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ມີ gateway. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຂຽນທັບພຶດຕິກຳນັ້ນໂດຍການຂ້າມກົດລະບຽບທັງໝົດແທນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:308
msgid "RAM Disk Settings (Reboot to Apply Changes)"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAM Disk (ຣີບູດເພື່ອໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:312
msgid "Use RAM Disks"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ RAM Disks"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:315
msgid ""
"Set this to use /tmp and /var as RAM disks (memory file system disks) on a "
"full install rather than use the hard disk. Setting this will cause the data "
"in /tmp and /var to be lost. RRD, DHCP leases and log directory will be "
"retained. Changing this setting will cause the firewall to reboot after "
"clicking \"Save\"."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ /tmp ແລະ /var ເປັນ RAM disks (ດິສກ໌ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ) ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງເຕັມແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຮາດດິສກ໌. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນໃນ /tmp ແລະ /var ສູນເສຍໄປ. RRD, ການເຊົ່າ DHCP ແລະໄດເລກະທໍຣີບັນທຶກຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້. ການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟວໍຣີບູດຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກ \"Save\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:320
msgid "RAM Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ RAM Disk"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:324
msgid "/tmp RAM Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ /tmp RAM Disk"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:328
msgid "/tmp RAM Disk<br />Do not set lower than 40."
msgstr "/tmp RAM Disk<br />ຢ່າຕັ້ງຕໍ່າກວ່າ 40."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:332
msgid "/var RAM Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ /var RAM Disk"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:336
msgid "/var RAM Disk<br />Do not set lower than 60."
msgstr "/var RAM Disk<br />ຢ່າຕັ້ງຕໍ່າກວ່າ 60."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:338
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Sets the size, in MiB, for the RAM disks. Ensure each RAM disk is large "
"enough to contain the current contents of the directories in question. "
"%sMaximum total size of all RAM disks cannot exceed available kernel memory: "
"%s"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດ, ເປັນ MiB, ສຳລັບ RAM disks. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ RAM disk ແຕ່ລະອັນມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະບັນຈຸເນື້ອຫາປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໄດເລກະທໍຣີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. %sຂະໜາດລວມສູງສຸດຂອງ RAM disks ທັງໝົດບໍ່ສາມາດເກີນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ kernel ທີ່ມີຢູ່: %s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:345
msgid "Periodic RAM Disk Data Backups"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ RAM Disk ແບບເປັນໄລຍະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:349
msgid "Periodic RRD Backup"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງ RRD ແບບເປັນໄລຍະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:353
#: src/usr/local/www/diag_backup.php:94
msgid "RRD Data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ RRD"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:357
msgid "Periodic DHCP Leases Backup"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງການເຊົ່າ DHCP ແບບເປັນໄລຍະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:361
#: src/usr/local/www/head.inc:358 src/usr/local/www/status_dhcp_leases.php:39
msgid "DHCP Leases"
msgstr "ການເຊົ່າ DHCP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:365
msgid "Periodic Logs Backup"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງບັນທຶກແບບເປັນໄລຍະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:369
#: src/usr/local/www/diag_smart.php:69
msgid "Log Directory"
msgstr "ໄດເລກະທໍຣີບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:371
msgid ""
"Sets the interval, in hours, to periodically backup these portions of RAM "
"disk data so they can be restored automatically on the next boot. Keep in "
"mind that the more frequent the backup, the more writes will happen to the "
"media."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງໄລຍະຫ່າງ, ເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ, ເພື່ອສຳຮອງສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ RAM disk ເປັນໄລຍະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດຟື້ນຟູໄດ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການບູດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ. ຈົ່ງຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າການສຳຮອງເລື້ອຍໆເທົ່າໃດ, ການຂຽນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນກໍຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບສື່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:379
msgid "Hardware Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮາດແວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:388
msgid "Always on"
msgstr "ເປີດຢູ່ສະເໝີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:386
msgid "Hard disk standby time"
msgstr "ເວລາສະແຕນບາຍຮາດດິສກ໌"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:389
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Puts the hard disk into standby mode when the selected number of minutes has "
"elapsed since the last access.%1$s%2$sDo not set this for CF cards.%3$s"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຮາດດິສກ໌ເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດສະແຕນບາຍເມື່ອຈຳນວນນາທີທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ຜ່ານໄປນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ.%1$s%2$sຢ່າຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສຳລັບບັດ CF.%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:394
msgid "Installation Feedback"
msgstr "ຄຳຕິຊົມການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:398
msgid "Netgate Device ID"
msgstr "ID ອຸປະກອນ Netgate"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:401
msgid ""
"Enable this option to not send Netgate Device ID as part of User-Agent "
"header."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົ່ງ ID ອຸປະກອນ Netgate ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງສ່ວນຫົວ User-Agent."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:407
msgid ""
"The \\\"Use Ramdisk\\\" setting has been changed. This requires the "
"firewall\\nto reboot.\\n\\nReboot now ?"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \\\"ໃຊ້ Ramdisk\\\" ໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ນີ້ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ໄຟວໍ\\nຣີບູດ.\\n\\nຣີບູດດຽວນີ້?"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:72
msgid "Password and confirmation must match."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານແລະການຢືນຢັນຕ້ອງກົງກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:76
msgid "pfsync Synchronize Peer IP must be an IPv4 IP."
msgstr "pfsync Synchronize Peer IP ຕ້ອງເປັນ IP IPv4."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:80
msgid "Synchronize Config to IP must be a valid IP address."
msgstr "Synchronize Config to IP ຕ້ອງເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:103
msgid "High Availability Sync"
msgstr "ການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄວາມພ້ອມສູງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:120
msgid "State Synchronization Settings (pfsync)"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະ (pfsync)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:124
msgid "Synchronize states"
msgstr "ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:128
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Each firewall sends these messages out via multicast on a specified "
"interface, using the PFSYNC protocol (IP Protocol 240). It also listens on "
"that interface for similar messages from other firewalls, and imports them "
"into the local state table.%1$sThis setting should be enabled on all members "
"of a failover group.%1$sClicking \"Save\" will force a configuration sync if "
"it is enabled! (see Configuration Synchronization Settings below)"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟວໍແຕ່ລະອັນສົ່ງຂໍຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອອກຜ່ານ multicast ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ລະບຸ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄອນ PFSYNC (IP Protocol 240). ມັນຍັງຟັງຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນັ້ນສຳລັບຂໍຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຈາກໄຟວໍອື່ນໆ, ແລະນຳເຂົ້າພວກມັນເຂົ້າໄປໃນຕາຕະລາງສະຖານະທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.%1$sການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຄວນເປີດใช้งานໃນສະມາຊິກທັງໝົດຂອງກຸ່ມ failover.%1$sການຄລິກ \"ບັນທຶກ\" ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖ້າມັນເປີດใช้งานຢູ່! (ເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂ້າງລຸ່ມ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:135
msgid "Synchronize Interface"
msgstr "ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນອິນເຕີເຟດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:138
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If Synchronize States is enabled this interface will be used for "
"communication.%1$sIt is recommended to set this to an interface other than "
"LAN! A dedicated interface works the best.%1$sAn IP must be defined on each "
"machine participating in this failover group.%1$sAn IP must be assigned to "
"the interface on any participating sync nodes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປີດใช้งาน Synchronize States ອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານ.%1$sແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນອິນເຕີເຟດອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກ LAN! ອິນເຕີເຟດສະເພາະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ.%1$sຕ້ອງກຳນົດ IP ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໃນກຸ່ມ failover ນີ້.%1$sຕ້ອງມອບໝາຍ IP ໃຫ້ກັບອິນເຕີເຟດໃນໂນດການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ."

