msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດການຈະລາຈອນທີ່ຈະຈັບພາບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:385
msgid "Select the protocol to capture, or \"Any\". "
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໂຕຄອນທີ່ຈະຈັບພາບ, ຫຼື \"Any\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:389
msgid "Host Address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ໂຮສ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:392
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This value is either the Source or Destination IP address, subnet in CIDR "
"notation, or MAC address.%1$sMatching can be negated by preceding the value "
"with \"!\". Multiple IP addresses or CIDR subnets may be specified. Comma "
"(\",\") separated values perform a boolean \"AND\". Separating with a pipe "
"(\"|\") performs a boolean \"OR\".%1$sMAC addresses must be entered in colon-"
"separated format, such as xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx or a partial address consisting "
"of one (xx), two (xx:xx), or four (xx:xx:xx:xx) segments.%1$sIf this field "
"is left blank, all packets on the specified interface will be captured."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ​ນີ້​ແມ່ນ​ທັງ IP address ຂອງ Source ຫຼື Destination, subnet ໃນ​ຮູບ​ແບບ CIDR, ຫຼື MAC address.%1$sການ​ຈັບ​ຄູ່​ສາ​ມາດ​ຖືກ​ປະ​ຕິ​ເສດ​ໂດຍ​ການ​ນຳ​ໜ້າ​ຄ່າ​ດ້ວຍ \"!\". IP addresses ຫຼາຍ​ອັນ ຫຼື CIDR subnets ສາ​ມາດ​ຖືກ​ລະ​ບຸ. ຄ່າ​ທີ່​ຂັ້ນ​ດ້ວຍ​ເຄື່ອງ​ໝາຍ​ຈຸດ (\",\") ປະ​ຕິ​ບັດ boolean \"AND\". ການ​ແຍກ​ດ້ວຍ​ທໍ່ (\"|\") ປະ​ຕິ​ບັດ boolean \"OR\".%1$sMAC addresses ຕ້ອງ​ຖືກ​ປ້ອນ​ໃນ​ຮູບ​ແບບ​ທີ່​ຂັ້ນ​ດ້ວຍ​ເຄື່ອງ​ໝາຍ​ຈຸດ, ເຊັ່ນ xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx ຫຼື​ທີ່​ຢູ່​ບາງ​ສ່ວນ​ທີ່​ປະ​ກອບ​ດ້ວຍ​ໜຶ່ງ (xx), ສອງ (xx:xx), ຫຼື​ສີ່ (xx:xx:xx:xx) segments.%1$sຖ້າ​ຊ່ອງ​ຂໍ້​ມູນ​ນີ້​ຖືກ​ປະ​ໄວ້​ຫວ່າງ​เปล่า, packets ທັງ​ໝົດ​ໃນ interface ທີ່​ລະ​ບຸ​ຈະ​ຖືກ​ຈັບ."
#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:401
#: src/usr/local/www/status_upnp.php:74
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_edit.php:393
#: src/usr/local/www/diag_testport.php:54
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:183
#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3473 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3497
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules.php:404
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules.php:406
msgid "Port"
msgstr "ພອດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:404
msgid ""
"The port can be either the source or destination port. The packet capture "
"will look for this port in either field. Matching can be negated by "
"preceding the value with \"!\". Multiple ports may be specified. Comma "
"(\",\") separated values perform a boolean \"AND\". Separating with a pipe "
"(\"|\") performs a boolean \"OR\".Leave blank if not filtering by port."
msgstr ""
"ພອດສາມາດເປັນພອດ source ຫຼື destination. ການຈັບ packet ຈະຊອກຫາພອດນີ້ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ. ການຈັບຄູ່ສາມາດຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍການນຳໜ້າຄ່າດ້ວຍ \"!\". ຫຼາຍພອດສາມາດຖືກລະບຸ. ຄ່າທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ (\",\") ປະຕິບັດ boolean \"AND\". ການແຍກດ້ວຍທໍ່ (\"|\") ປະຕິບັດ boolean \"OR\". ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ກັ່ນຕອງຕາມພອດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:410
msgid "Packet Length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວແພັກເກັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:413
msgid ""
"The Packet length is the number of bytes of each packet that will be "
"captured. Default value is 0, which will capture the entire frame regardless "
"of its size."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວແພັກເກັດແມ່ນຈຳນວນ bytes ຂອງແພັກເກັດແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ຈະຖືກຈັບພາບ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0, ເຊິ່ງຈະຈັບພາບເຟຣມທັງໝົດໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງມັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:418
#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers_edit.php:75
#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:55
msgid "Count"
msgstr "ນັບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:421
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is the number of packets the packet capture will grab. Default value is "
"100.%sEnter 0 (zero) for no count limit."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດທີ່ການຈັບພາບແພັກເກັດຈະຈັບ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 100.%sປ້ອນ 0 (ສູນ) ສຳລັບບໍ່ມີຂີດຈຳກັດການນັບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:430
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "ປານກາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:432
msgid "Full"
msgstr "ເຕັມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:427
msgid "Level of detail"
msgstr "ລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:435
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is the level of detail that will be displayed after hitting \"Stop\" "
"when the packets have been captured.%sThis option does not affect the level "
"of detail when downloading the packet capture. "
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຈະສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກກົດ \"Stop\" ເມື່ອແພັກເກັດຖືກຈັບພາບ.%sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດເມື່ອດາວໂຫຼດການຈັບພາບແພັກເກັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:441
msgid "Reverse DNS Lookup"
msgstr "ການຊອກຫາ DNS ແບບປີ້ນກັບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The packet capture will perform a reverse DNS lookup associated with all IP "
"addresses.%sThis option can cause delays for large packet captures."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັບພາບແພັກເກັດຈະດຳເນີນການຊອກຫາ DNS ແບບປີ້ນກັບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທັງໝົດ.%sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຊັກຊ້າສຳລັບການຈັບພາບແພັກເກັດຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:474
