msgid "Client Identifier"
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸລູກຄ້າ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:496
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If an IPv4 address is entered, the address must be outside of the pool."
"%1$sIf no IPv4 address is given, one will be dynamically allocated from the "
"pool.%1$s%1$sThe same IP address may be assigned to multiple mappings."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4, ທີ່ຢູ່ຕ້ອງຢູ່ນອກສະນຸກເກີ."
"%1$sຖ້າບໍ່ມີທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4, ຈະຖືກຈັດສັນແບບໄດນາມິກຈາກສະນຸກເກີ.%1$s%1$sທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນອາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຫຼາຍ mappings."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:505
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6_edit.php:225
msgid "Name of the host, without domain part."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງໂຮສ, ບໍ່ມີສ່ວນໂດເມນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:510
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6_edit.php:237
msgid "Netboot filename"
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ Netboot"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:513
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6_edit.php:240
msgid ""
"Name of the file that should be loaded when this host boots off of the "
"network, overrides setting on main page."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຄວນໂຫຼດເມື່ອໂຮສນີ້ບູດອອກຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໜ້າຫຼັກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:517
msgid "Root Path"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງຮາກ"

