msgid "Enter the root-path-string, overrides setting on main page."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ root-path-string, ຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໜ້າຫຼັກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:532
