msgid "WINS Servers"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ WINS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:590
msgid ""
"Note: leave blank to use the system default DNS servers - this interface's "
"IP if DNS Forwarder or Resolver is enabled, otherwise the servers configured "
"on the General page."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີ DNS ຕັ້ງຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ - IP ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ຖ້າເປີດใช้งาน DNS Forwarder ຫຼື Resolver, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນໜ້າທົ່ວໄປ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:599
msgid ""
"The default is to use the IP on this interface of the firewall as the "
"gateway. Specify an alternate gateway here if this is not the correct "
"gateway for the network."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການໃຊ້ IP ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ຂອງ firewall ເປັນ gateway. ລະບຸ gateway ອື່ນທີ່ນີ້ຖ້ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ gateway ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:617
msgid "Default lease time (Seconds)"
msgstr "ເວລາເຊົ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ວິນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:620
msgid ""
"Used for clients that do not ask for a specific expiration time. The default "
"is 7200 seconds."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮ້ອງຂໍເວລາໝົດອາຍຸສະເພາະ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 7200 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:624
msgid "Maximum lease time (Seconds)"
msgstr "ເວລາເຊົ່າສູງສຸດ (ວິນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:652
msgid "DDNS Hostname"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສ DDNS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:662
msgid ""
"Leave blank to disable dynamic DNS registration. Enter the dynamic DNS "
"domain which will be used to register client names in the DNS server. Only "
"the first defined set of option for each domain will be honored if it is "
"used for multiple interfaces/entries."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອປິດການລົງທະບຽນ DNS ແບບໄດນາມິກ. ປ້ອນໂດເມນ DNS ແບບໄດນາມິກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຊື່ລູກຄ້າໃນເຊີບເວີ DNS. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຊຸດຕົວເລືອກທຳອິດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂດເມນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາ ຖ້າມັນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຫຼາຍອິນເຕີເຟດ/ລາຍການ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:755
msgid "TFTP servers"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ TFTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:764
msgid ""
"Leave blank to disable. Enter a full hostname or IP for the TFTP server."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອປິດການใช้งาน. ປ້ອນຊື່ໂຮສເຕັມ ຫຼື IP ສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ TFTP."

