#: src/usr/local/www/system.php:526
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Do not end the domain name with '.local' as the final part (Top Level "
"Domain, TLD), The 'local' TLD is %1$swidely used%2$s by mDNS (e.g. Avahi, "
"Bonjour, Rendezvous, Airprint, Airplay) and some Windows systems and "
"networked devices. These will not network correctly if the router uses "
"'local' as its TLD. Alternative TLDs such as 'local.lan' or 'mylocal' are "
"safe."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າຈົບຊື່ໂດເມນດ້ວຍ '.local' ເປັນສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍ (Top Level "
"Domain, TLD). TLD 'local' ຖືກ %1$s ໃຊ້ຢ່າງແຜ່ຫຼາຍ %2$s ໂດຍ mDNS "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: Avahi, Bonjour, Rendezvous, Airprint, Airplay) ແລະລະບົບ Windows "
"ບາງສ່ວນລວມທັງອຸປະກອນເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ອຸປະກອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ "
"ຖ້າ router ໃຊ້ 'local' ເປັນ TLD. TLD ທີ່ເປັນທາງເລືອກຄື 'local.lan' ຫຼື 'mylocal' "
"ມີຄວາມປອດໄພ."

