#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_mobile.php:198
msgid ""
"A valid IP address for 'Virtual Address Pool Network' must be specified."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ 'ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ເສມືອນ'."  

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_mobile.php:203
msgid ""
"A valid IPv6 address for 'Virtual IPv6 Address Pool Network' must be "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ 'ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ເສມືອນ'."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_mobile.php:207
msgid "An integer must be specified for RADIUS Retrasmit Base."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸຄ່າຈຳນວນເຕັມສຳລັບ RADIUS Retransmit Base."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_mobile.php:210
msgid "An integer must be specified for RADIUS Retrasmit Timeout."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸຄ່າຈຳນວນເຕັມສຳລັບ RADIUS Retransmit Timeout."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_mobile.php:213
msgid "An integer must be specified for RADIUS Retrasmit Tries."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸຄ່າຈຳນວນເຕັມສຳລັບ RADIUS Retransmit Tries."


#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_mobile.php:216
msgid "An integer must be specified for RADIUS Sockets."
