#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:564
msgid ""
"If this option is not set, all NetBIOS-over-TCP/IP options (including WINS) "
"will be disabled. "
msgstr "ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕົວເລືອກ NetBIOS-over-TCP/IP ທັງໝົດ (ລວມທັງ WINS) ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:568
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1511
