msgstr "ບໍ່ມີ RDR (NOT)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_edit.php:186
msgid ""
"This option is rarely needed. Don't use this without thorough knowledge of "
"the implications."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍຈຳເປັນ. ຢ່າໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມຮູ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຜົນກະທົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_edit.php:212
msgid ""
"Choose which protocol this rule should match. In most cases \"TCP\" is "
"specified."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໂຕຄອນທີ່ກົດລະບຽບນີ້ຄວນກົງກັນ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ \"TCP\" ຖືກກຳນົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_edit.php:233
