msgid ""
"Enter the modem initialization string here. Do NOT include the \"AT\" string "
"at the beginning of the command. Many modern USB 3G modems don't need an "
"initialization string."
msgstr "ປ້ອນສະຕຣິງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂມເດັມຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້. ຢ່າລວມສະຕຣິງ \"AT\" ຢູ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ. ໂມເດັມ USB 3G ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝຫຼາຍອັນບໍ່ຕ້ອງການສະຕຣິງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:676
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "ໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:679
msgid ""
"Enter timeout in seconds for connection to be established (sec.) Default is "
"45 sec."
msgstr "ປ້ອນເວລາໝົດໃນວິນາທີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖືກສ້າງຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນ (ວິນາທີ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 45 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:683
msgid "Uptime logging"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກເວລາເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:686
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Causes cumulative uptime to be recorded and displayed on the %1$sStatus-"
">Interfaces%2$s page."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະສົມຖືກບັນທຶກ ແລະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ %1$sສະຖານະ->ອິນເຕີເຟສ%2s."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:689
#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2916
msgid "Service name"
msgstr "ຊື່ບໍລິການ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:706
msgid ""
"This field can usually be left empty. Service name will not be configured if "
"this field is empty. Check the \"Configure NULL\" box to configure a blank "
"Service name."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້. ຊື່ບໍລິການຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຖ້າຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຫວ່າງ. ກວດເບິ່ງກ່ອງ \"Configure NULL\" ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ບໍລິການຫວ່າງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:719
#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2949
msgid "Pre-set"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:714
msgid "Periodic Reset"
msgstr "ຣີເຊັດເປັນໄລຍະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:721
msgid "Select a reset timing type"
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດເວລາຣີເຊັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:723
msgid "Reset Date/Time"
msgstr "ວັນທີ/ເວລາຣີເຊັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:746
msgid "Specific date"
msgstr "ວັນທີສະເພາະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:748
msgid ""
"Leaving the date field empty will cause the reset to be executed each day at "
"the time specified in the minutes and hour fields. "
msgstr "ການປ່ອຍຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນວັນທີຫວ່າງໄວ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຣີເຊັດຖືກປະຕິບັດໃນແຕ່ລະມື້ໃນເວລາທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງນາທີ ແລະຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:752
msgid "Reset frequency"
msgstr "ຄວາມຖີ່ຣີເຊັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:799
msgid "Advanced options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:810
msgid "Dial On Demand"
msgstr "ໂທຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:813
msgid ""
"Causes the interface to operate in dial-on-demand mode. Do NOT enable if the "
"link is to remain continuously connected. The interface is configured, but "
"the actual connection of the link is delayed until qualifying outgoing "
"traffic is detected."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ອິນເຕີເຟສເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດໂທຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ຢ່າເປີດໃຊ້ງານຖ້າລິ້ງຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ອິນເຕີເຟສຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແຕ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວຈິງຂອງລິ້ງຖືກຊັກຊ້າຈົນກວ່າການຈະລາຈອນຂາອອກທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກກວດພົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:818
msgid "Idle Timeout"
msgstr "ໝົດເວລາບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:821
msgid ""
"If no incoming or outgoing packets are transmitted for the entered number of "
"seconds the connection is brought down. When the idle timeout occurs, if the "
"dial-on-demand option is enabled, mpd goes back into dial-on-demand mode. "
"Otherwise, the interface is brought down and all associated routes removed."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດຂາເຂົ້າ ຫຼືຂາອອກຖືກສົ່ງເປັນຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າມາ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຖືກຕັດລົງ. ເມື່ອໝົດເວລາບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກໂທຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, mpd ຈະກັບຄືນສູ່ໂໝດໂທຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ອິນເຕີເຟສຈະຖືກຕັດລົງ ແລະເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:830
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Disable vjcomp(compression) (auto-negotiated by default).%1$sThis option "
"enables Van Jacobson TCP header compression, which saves several bytes per "
"TCP data packet. This option is almost always required. Compression is not "
"effective for TCP connections with enabled modern extensions like time "
"stamping or SACK, which modify TCP options between sequential packets."
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ vjcomp(ການບີບອັດ) (ເຈລະຈາອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).%1$sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການບີບອັດສ່ວນຫົວ TCP ຂອງ Van Jacobson, ເຊິ່ງປະຢັດຫຼາຍໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ແພັກເກັດຂໍ້ມູນ TCP. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ແມ່ນເກືອບວ່າຕ້ອງການສະເໝີ. ການບີບອັດບໍ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ທີ່ມີການຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ທັນສະໄໝເຊັ່ນ: ການປະທັບເວລາ ຫຼື SACK, ເຊິ່ງແກ້ໄຂຕົວເລືອກ TCP ລະຫວ່າງແພັກເກັດຕາມລຳດັບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:837
msgid "TCPmssFix"
msgstr "TCPmssFix"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:840
msgid ""
"Causes mpd to adjust incoming and outgoing TCP SYN segments so that the "
"requested maximum segment size is not greater than the amount allowed by the "
"interface MTU. This is necessary in many setups to avoid problems caused by "
"routers that drop ICMP Datagram Too Big messages. Without these messages, "
"the originating machine sends data, it passes the rogue router then hits a "
"machine that has an MTU that is not big enough for the data. Because the IP "
"Don't Fragment option is set, this machine sends an ICMP Datagram Too Big "
"message back to the originator and drops the packet. The rogue router drops "
"the ICMP message and the originator never gets to discover that it must "
"reduce the fragment size or drop the IP Don't Fragment option from its "
"outgoing data."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ mpd ປັບສ່ວນ TCP SYN ຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະຂາອອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂະໜາດສ່ວນສູງສຸດທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍບໍ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈຳນວນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໂດຍ MTU ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍອັນເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາທີ່ເກີດຈາກເຣົາເຕີທີ່ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ICMP Datagram Too Big. ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນທາງສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ມັນຜ່ານເຣົາເຕີທີ່ບໍ່ດີແລ້ວຕີເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີ MTU ທີ່ບໍ່ໃຫຍ່ພໍສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຕົວເລືອກ IP Don't Fragment ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເຄື່ອງນີ້ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ICMP Datagram Too Big ກັບຄືນໄປຫາຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະລຶບແພັກເກັດ. ເຣົາເຕີທີ່ບໍ່ດີລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມ ICMP ແລະຕົ້ນທາງບໍ່ເຄີຍຄົ້ນພົບວ່າມັນຕ້ອງຫຼຸດຂະໜາດສ່ວນ ຫຼືລຶບຕົວເລືອກ IP Don't Fragment ອອກຈາກຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກຂອງມັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:848
msgid "ShortSeq"
msgstr "ShortSeq"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:851
msgid ""
"This option is only meaningful if multi-link PPP is negotiated. It "
"proscribes shorter multi-link fragment headers, saving two bytes on every "
"frame. It is not necessary to disable this for connections that are not "
"multi-link."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າ multi-link PPP ຖືກເຈລະຈາ. ມັນຫ້າມສ່ວນຫົວຂອງສ່ວນ multi-link ທີ່ສັ້ນກວ່າ, ປະຢັດສອງໄບຕ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະເຟຣມ. ມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ multi-link."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:856
msgid "ACFComp"
msgstr "ACFComp"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:859
msgid ""
"Address and control field compression. This option only applies to "
"asynchronous link types. It saves two bytes per frame."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດຊ່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ ແລະຄວບຄຸມ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບປະເພດລິ້ງແບບ asynchronous. ມັນປະຢັດສອງໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ເຟຣມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:863
msgid "ProtoComp"
msgstr "ProtoComp"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:866
msgid ""
"Protocol field compression. This option saves one byte per frame for most "
"frames."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດຊ່ອງໂປຣໂຕຄໍ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ປະຢັດໜຶ່ງໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ເຟຣມສຳລັບເຟຣມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:870
msgid "Multilink over single link"
msgstr "Multilink ຜ່ານລິ້ງດຽວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:873
msgid ""
"Enable if the provider supports LCP multilink extensions over single link "
"(will ignore MTU / MRU settings)"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຖ້າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍ LCP multilink ຜ່ານລິ້ງດຽວ (ຈະລະເລີຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ MTU / MRU)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:877
msgid "Force MTU"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບ MTU"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:880
msgid ""
"Overwrite the result of LCP negotiation with a known working higher value. "
"WARNING: This option violates RFC 1661 and can break connectivity."
msgstr "ຂຽນທັບຜົນຂອງການເຈລະຈາ LCP ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສູງກວ່າ. ຄຳເຕືອນ: ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ລະເມີດ RFC 1661 ແລະສາມາດທຳລາຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:885
msgid "Link Parameters ("
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີລິ້ງ ("

