msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1516
#: src/usr/local/www/diag_smart.php:295 src/usr/local/www/diag_smart.php:298
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules.php:936
msgid "Log"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1519
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hint: the firewall has limited local log space. Don't turn on logging for "
"everything. If doing a lot of logging, consider using a remote syslog server "
"(see the %1$sStatus: System Logs: Settings%2$s page)."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳ: ໄຟວໍມີພື້ນທີ່ບັນທຶກທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈຳກັດ. ຢ່າເປີດການບັນທຶກສຳລັບທຸກຢ່າງ. ຖ້າກຳລັງເຮັດການບັນທຶກຫຼາຍ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດ (ເບິ່ງໜ້າ %1$sສະຖານະ: ບັນທຶກລະບົບ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ%2$s)."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1528
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A description may be entered here for administrative reference. A maximum of "
"%s characters will be used in the ruleset and displayed in the firewall log."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍອາດຈະຖືກປ້ອນຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງການບໍລິຫານ. ສູງສຸດ %s ຕົວອັກສອນຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຊຸດກົດລະບຽບ ແລະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນບັນທຶກໄຟວໍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1553
msgid "Source OS"
msgstr "OS ຕົ້ນທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1556
msgid ""
"Note: this only works for TCP rules. General OS choice matches all subtypes."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ນີ້ເຮັດວຽກກັບກົດລະບຽບ TCP ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການເລືອກ OS ທົ່ວໄປກົງກັບປະເພດຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1560
msgid "Diffserv Code Point"
msgstr "ຈຸດລະຫັດ Diffserv"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1567
msgid "Allow IP options"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດຕົວເລືອກ IP"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1585
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A packet matching this rule can be marked and this mark used to match on "
"other NAT/filter rules. It is called %1$sPolicy filtering%2$s."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດທີ່ກົງກັບກົດລະບຽບນີ້ສາມາດຖືກໝາຍ ແລະເຄື່ອງໝາຍນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບກົດລະບຽບ NAT/ການກັ່ນຕອງອື່ນໆ. ມັນຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າການກັ່ນຕອງນະໂຍບາຍ %1$s%2$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1588
#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1599
msgid "Tagged"
msgstr "Tagged"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1592
msgid "nottagged"
msgstr "nottagged"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1604
msgid ""
"Match a mark placed on a packet by a different rule with the Tag option. "
"Check Invert to match packets which do not contain this tag."
msgstr "ກົງກັບເຄື່ອງໝາຍທີ່ວາງໄວ້ໃນແພັກເກັດໂດຍກົດລະບຽບອື່ນດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ Tag. ກວດເບິ່ງ Invert ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ມີແທັກນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1610
msgid "Max. states"
msgstr "ສະຖານະສູງສຸດ"

