msgid "DNpipe"
msgstr "DNpipe"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1755
msgid "PDNpipe"
msgstr "PDNpipe"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1760
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Choose the Out queue/Virtual interface only if In is also selected. The Out "
"selection is applied to traffic leaving the interface where the rule is "
"created, the In selection is applied to traffic coming into the chosen "
"interface.%1$sIf creating a floating rule, if the direction is In then the "
"same rules apply, if the direction is Out the selections are reversed, Out "
"is for incoming and In is for outgoing."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄິວ Out/ອິນເຕີເຟສສະເໝືອນຖ້າເລືອກ In ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ການເລືອກ Out ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບການຈະລາຈອນທີ່ອອກຈາກອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ກົດລະບຽບຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ການເລືອກ In ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບການຈະລາຈອນທີ່ເຂົ້າມາໃນອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເລືອກ.%1$sຖ້າສ້າງກົດລະບຽບ floating, ຖ້າທິດທາງແມ່ນ In ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນກົດລະບຽບດຽວກັນນຳໃຊ້, ຖ້າທິດທາງແມ່ນ Out ການເລືອກແມ່ນປີ້ນກັບ, Out ແມ່ນສຳລັບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ In ແມ່ນສຳລັບຂາອອກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1769
msgid "Ackqueue / Queue"
msgstr "Ackqueue / Queue"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1773
msgid "Ackqueue"
msgstr "Ackqueue"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1780 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:1835
msgid "Default Queue"
msgstr "ຄິວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1785
msgid "Choose the Acknowledge Queue only if there is a selected Queue."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄິວ Acknowledge ຖ້າມີຄິວທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_defaults.php:43 src/usr/local/www/head.inc:398
