#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:82
msgid "IPv6 Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:86
msgid "Allow IPv6"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:89
msgid ""
"NOTE: This does not disable any IPv6 features on the firewall, it only "
"blocks traffic."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດ IPv6 ໃດໆໃນໄຟວໍ, ມັນພຽງແຕ່ບລັອກການຈະລາຈອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:94
msgid "IPv6 over IPv4 Tunneling"
msgstr "IPv6 ຜ່ານ IPv4 Tunneling"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:97
#, php-format
msgid ""
"These options create an RFC 2893 compatible mechanism for IPv4 NAT "
"encapsulation of IPv6 packets, that can be used to tunnel IPv6 packets over "
"IPv4 routing infrastructures. IPv6 firewall rules are %1$salso required%2$s, "
"to control and pass encapsulated traffic."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສ້າງກົນໄກທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ RFC 2893 ສຳລັບການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ IPv4 NAT ຂອງແພັກເກັດ IPv6, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ tunneling ແພັກເກັດ IPv6 ຜ່ານໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການເສັ້ນທາງ IPv4. ກົດລະບຽບໄຟວໍ IPv6 %1$sກໍຈຳເປັນເຊັ່ນກັນ%2$s, ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ ແລະສົ່ງການຈະລາຈອນທີ່ຫຸ້ມຫໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:103
msgid "IPv4 address of Tunnel Peer"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ຂອງ Tunnel Peer"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:110
msgid "Prefer IPv4 over IPv6"
msgstr "ມັກ IPv4 ຫຼາຍກວ່າ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:113
msgid ""
"By default, if IPv6 is configured and a hostname resolves IPv6 and IPv4 "
"addresses, IPv6 will be used. If this option is selected, IPv4 will be "
"preferred over IPv6."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຖ້າ IPv6 ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະຊື່ໂຮສແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ແລະ IPv4, IPv6 ຈະຖືກໃຊ້. ຖ້າເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, IPv4 ຈະຖືກມັກຫຼາຍກວ່າ IPv6."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:118
msgid "IPv6 DNS entry"
msgstr "ລາຍການ DNS IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:121
msgid ""
"If a LAN interface's IPv6 configuration is set to Track, and the tracked "
"interface loses connectivity, it can cause connections to this firewall that "
"were established via hostname to fail. This can happen unintentionally when "
"accessing the firewall by hostname, since by default both IPv4 and IPv6 "
"entries are added to the system's DNS. Enabling this option prevents those "
"IPv6 records from being created."
msgstr "ຖ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPv6 ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ LAN ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ Track, ແລະອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ຕິດຕາມສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ມັນສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໄຟວໍນີ້ທີ່ສ້າງຕັ້ງຜ່ານຊື່ໂຮສລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈເມື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟວໍໂດຍຊື່ໂຮສ, ເນື່ອງຈາກໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທັງລາຍການ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ DNS ຂອງລະບົບ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກ IPv6 ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:130
msgid "Raw DUID: As stored in DUID file or seen in firewall logs"
msgstr "Raw DUID: ຕາມທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ DUID ຫຼືເຫັນໃນບັນທຶກໄຟວໍ"

