#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:222
msgid "Hardware Checksum Offloading"
msgstr "Hardware Checksum Offloading"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:225
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Checking this option will disable hardware checksum offloading.%1$sChecksum "
"offloading is broken in some hardware, particularly some Realtek cards. "
"Rarely, drivers may have problems with checksum offloading and some specific "
"NICs. This will take effect after a machine reboot or re-configure of each "
"interface."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານ hardware checksum offloading.%1$sChecksum offloading ເສຍຫາຍໃນບາງຮາດແວ, ໂດຍສະເພາະບັດ Realtek ບາງອັນ. ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີ, ໄດເວີອາດມີບັນຫາກັບ checksum offloading ແລະ NIC ສະເພາະບາງອັນ. ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກເຄື່ອງຣີບູດ ຫຼືຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ຂອງແຕ່ລະອິນເຕີເຟສ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:233
msgid "Hardware TCP Segmentation Offloading"
msgstr "Hardware TCP Segmentation Offloading"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:236
msgid ""
"Checking this option will disable hardware TCP segmentation offloading (TSO, "
"TSO4, TSO6). This offloading is broken in some hardware drivers, and may "
"impact performance with some specific NICs. This will take effect after a "
"machine reboot or re-configure of each interface."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານ hardware TCP segmentation offloading (TSO, TSO4, TSO6). ການ offloading ນີ້ເສຍຫາຍໃນບາງໄດເວີຮາດແວ, ແລະອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບກັບ NIC ສະເພາະບາງອັນ. ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກເຄື່ອງຣີບູດ ຫຼືຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ຂອງແຕ່ລະອິນເຕີເຟສ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:243
msgid "Hardware Large Receive Offloading"
msgstr "Hardware Large Receive Offloading"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:246
msgid ""
"Checking this option will disable hardware large receive offloading (LRO). "
"This offloading is broken in some hardware drivers, and may impact "
"performance with some specific NICs. This will take effect after a machine "
"reboot or re-configure of each interface."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານ hardware large receive offloading (LRO). ການ offloading ນີ້ເສຍຫາຍໃນບາງໄດເວີຮາດແວ, ແລະອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບກັບ NIC ສະເພາະບາງອັນ. ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກເຄື່ອງຣີບູດ ຫຼືຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ຂອງແຕ່ລະອິນເຕີເຟສ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:253
msgid "hn ALTQ support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ hn ALTQ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:256
msgid ""
"Checking this option will enable the ALTQ support for hn NICs. The ALTQ "
"support disables the multiqueue API and may reduce the system capability to "
"handle traffic. This will take effect after a machine reboot."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຮອງຮັບ ALTQ ສຳລັບ hn NICs. ການຮອງຮັບ ALTQ ປິດໃຊ້ງານ multiqueue API ແລະອາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສາມາດຂອງລະບົບໃນການຈັດການການຈະລາຈອນ. ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກເຄື່ອງຣີບູດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:262
msgid "ARP Handling"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ ARP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:265
msgid ""
"This option will suppress ARP log messages when multiple interfaces reside "
"on the same broadcast domain."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະສະກັດກັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກ ARP ເມື່ອອິນເຕີເຟສຫຼາຍອັນຢູ່ໃນໂດເມນການອອກອາກາດດຽວກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:270
msgid "Reset All States"
msgstr "ຣີເຊັດສະຖານະທັງໝົດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:273
msgid ""
"This option resets all states when a WAN IP Address changes instead of only "
"states associated with the previous IP Address."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຣີເຊັດສະຖານະທັງໝົດເມື່ອທີ່ຢູ່ IP WAN ປ່ຽນແທນທີ່ຈະຣີເຊັດສະຖານະທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ກ່ອນໜ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

