msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ດຽວອາດຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:354
msgid "*Server Address"
msgstr "*ທີ່ຢູ່ເຊີບເວີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:356
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Enter the IP address the PPPoE server should give to clients for use as "
"their \"gateway\".%1$sTypically this is set to an unused IP just outside of "
"the client range.%1$sNOTE: This should NOT be set to any IP address "
"currently in use on this firewall."
msgstr "ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ເຊີບເວີ PPPoE ຄວນໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າໃຊ້ເປັນ \"gateway\" ຂອງພວກເຂົາ.%1$sໂດຍທົ່ວໄປນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ IP ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດລູກຄ້າ.%1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ໃດໆທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນໄຟວໍນີ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:362
msgid "*Remote Address Range"
msgstr "*ຂອບເຂດທີ່ຢູ່ຣີໂໝດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:368
msgid "*Subnet mask"
msgstr "*ໜ້າກາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:371
msgid "Hint: 24 is 255.255.255.0"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳ: 24 ແມ່ນ 255.255.255.0"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:391
msgid ""
"If entered these servers will be given to all PPPoE clients, otherwise LAN "
"DNS and one WAN DNS will go to all clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າປ້ອນເຊີບເວີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກມອບໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າ PPPoE ທັງໝົດ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ LAN DNS ແລະ WAN DNS ໜຶ່ງຈະໄປຫາລູກຄ້າທັງໝົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:398
msgid ""
"Users will be authenticated using the RADIUS server specified below. The "
"local user database will not be used."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກກວດສອບສິດໂດຍໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້. ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:413
msgid "If primary server fails all requests will be sent via backup server."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຊີບເວີຫຼັກລົ້ມເຫຼວຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານເຊີບເວີສຳຮອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:417
msgid "NAS IP Address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP NAS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:419
msgid "NAS IP Address sent to the RADIUS Server"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP NAS ທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ RADIUS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:423
msgid "RADIUS Accounting Update"
msgstr "ການປັບປຸງການບັນຊີ RADIUS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:426
msgid "RADIUS accounting update period in seconds"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາການປັບປຸງການບັນຊີ RADIUS ເປັນວິນາທີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:430
msgid "RADIUS Issued IP Addresses"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ອອກໂດຍ RADIUS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:435
msgid "Primary RADIUS Server"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ຫຼັກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:455
#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:488
msgid "Accounting port (optional)"
msgstr "ພອດການບັນຊີ (ທາງເລືອກ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:457
#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:490
msgid "Standard ports are 1812 (authentication) and 1813 (accounting)."
msgstr "ພອດມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນ 1812 (ການກວດສອບສິດ) ແລະ 1813 (ການບັນຊີ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:463
msgid "Primary RADIUS Server Shared Secret"
msgstr "ຄວາມລັບທີ່ແບ່ງປັນຂອງເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ຫຼັກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:468
msgid "Secondary RADIUS Server"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ສຳຮອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:496
msgid "Secondary RADIUS Server Shared Secret"
msgstr "ຄວາມລັບທີ່ແບ່ງປັນຂອງເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ສຳຮອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:499
msgid ""
"Enter the shared secret that will be used to authenticate to the backup "
"RADIUS server."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຄວາມລັບທີ່ແບ່ງປັນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນສິດກັບເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ສຳຮອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:525
msgid "User table"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:565
msgid "Add user"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:600
msgid ""
"Don't forget to add a firewall rule to permit traffic from PPPoE clients."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມເພີ່ມກົດລະບຽບໄຟວໍເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດການຈະລາຈອນຈາກລູກຄ້າ PPPoE."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:59
msgid "Setting default NTPd settings"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າ NTPd ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:159
msgid "The submitted GPS type is invalid."
msgstr "ປະເພດ GPS ທີ່ສົ່ງມາບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:319
msgid "Updated NTP GPS Settings"
msgstr "ອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ NTP GPS ແລ້ວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:340
msgid "RMC"
msgstr "RMC"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:341
msgid "GGA"
msgstr "GGA"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:342
msgid "GLL"
msgstr "GLL"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:343
msgid "ZDA or ZDG"
msgstr "ZDA ຫຼື ZDG"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:382
msgid "NTP Serial GPS Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ NTP Serial GPS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:395
msgid "GPS Type"
msgstr "ປະເພດ GPS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:398
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This option allows a predefined configuration to be selected. Default is the "
"configuration of %1$s 2.1 and earlier (not recommended). Select Generic if "
"the GPS is not listed.%2$sThe predefined configurations assume the GPS has "
"already been set to NMEA mode."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ %1$s 2.1 ແລະກ່ອນໜ້າ (ບໍ່ແນະນຳ). ເລືອກ Generic ຖ້າ GPS ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້.%2$sການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າສົມມຸດວ່າ GPS ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນໂໝດ NMEA ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:417
msgid ""
"All serial ports are listed, be sure to pick the port with the GPS attached. "
""
msgstr "ພອດ serial ທັງໝົດຖືກລະບຸໄວ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກພອດທີ່ມີ GPS ຕິດຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:425
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A higher baud rate is generally only helpful if the GPS is sending too many "
"sentences. It is recommended to configure the GPS to send only one sentence "
"at a baud rate of 4800 or 9600.%1$sAutoset tries to find the correct baud "
"rate of the GPS device and then saves the configuration.%1$sAlways Auto "
"tries to find the correct baud rate of the GPS device every time NTPd is "
"started."
msgstr "ອັດຕາ baud ທີ່ສູງກວ່າໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວມີປະໂຫຍດພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າ GPS ສົ່ງປະໂຫຍກຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPS ໃຫ້ສົ່ງພຽງປະໂຫຍກດຽວໃນອັດຕາ baud 4800 ຫຼື 9600.%1$sAutoset ພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາອັດຕາ baud ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ GPS ແລະຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.%1$sAlways Auto ພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາອັດຕາ baud ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ GPS ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ NTPd ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:436
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Before sending the initialization commands, check the GPS baud rate. If it "
"is not correct try to find the correct baud rate automatically, send the "
"initialization commands if the correct rate is found, and then set the baud "
"rate to the configured speed.%1$sThis is useful if the GPS device resets "
"back to a default rate on power loss or when changing the baud rate."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ກວດເບິ່ງອັດຕາ baud ຂອງ GPS. ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາອັດຕາ baud ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖ້າພົບອັດຕາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງອັດຕາ baud ໃຫ້ກັບຄວາມໄວທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້.%1$sນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າອຸປະກອນ GPS ຣີເຊັດກັບຄືນສູ່ອັດຕາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອໄຟຟ້າຂັດຂ້ອງ ຫຼືເມື່ອປ່ຽນອັດຕາ baud."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:447
msgid "NMEA Sentences"
msgstr "ປະໂຫຍກ NMEA"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:451
msgid ""
"By default NTP will listen for all supported NMEA sentences. One or more "
"sentences to listen for may be specified."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ NTP ຈະຟັງປະໂຫຍກ NMEA ທີ່ຮອງຮັບທັງໝົດ. ປະໂຫຍກໜຶ່ງ ຫຼືຫຼາຍປະໂຫຍກທີ່ຈະຟັງອາດຈະຖືກລະບຸ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:462
msgid "Fudge Time 1"
msgstr "Fudge Time 1"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:465
msgid ""
"Fudge time 1 is used to specify the GPS PPS signal offset (default: 0.0)."
msgstr "Fudge time 1 ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸການຊົດເຊີຍສັນຍານ GPS PPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0.0)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:469
msgid "Fudge Time 2"
msgstr "Fudge Time 2"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:472
msgid "Fudge time 2 is used to specify the GPS time offset (default: 0.0)."
msgstr "Fudge time 2 ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸການຊົດເຊີຍເວລາ GPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0.0)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:476
msgid "Stratum (0-16)"
msgstr "Stratum (0-16)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:479
msgid ""
"This may be used to change the GPS Clock stratum (default: 0). This may be "
"useful to, for some reason, have ntpd prefer a different clock."
msgstr "ນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ GPS Clock stratum (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0). ນີ້ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດ, ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ ntpd ມັກໂມງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:542
msgid ""
"Enabling this will rapidly fill the log, but is useful for tuning Fudge time "
"2."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ນີ້ຈະຕື່ມບັນທຶກຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແຕ່ມີປະໂຫຍດສໍາລັບການປັບ Fudge time 2."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:549
msgid ""
"Enable extended GPS status if GPGSV or GPGGA are explicitly enabled by GPS "
"initialization commands."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ສະຖານະ GPS ຂະຫຍາຍ ຖ້າ GPGSV ຫຼື GPGGA ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໂດຍຄຳສັ່ງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ GPS."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:557
msgid "This may be used to change the GPS Clock ID (default: GPS)."
msgstr "ນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ GPS Clock ID (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: GPS)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:570
msgid "GPS Initialization"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ GPS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:578
msgid ""
"Commands entered here will be sent to the GPS during initialization. Please "
"read and understand the GPS documentation before making any changes here."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ປ້ອນຢູ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ GPS ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ກະລຸນາອ່ານ ແລະເຂົ້າໃຈເອກະສານ GPS ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆຢູ່ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:585
msgid ""
"Calculates and appends checksum and missing special characters \"$\" and "
"\"*\". May not work with some GPS models."
msgstr "ຄຳນວນ ແລະເພີ່ມ checksum ແລະຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ \"$\" ແລະ \"*\". ອາດຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບ GPS ບາງລຸ້ນ."

