"%1$sAddress%2$s.%3$sThe %1$sAddress%2$s can be an Interface, a Host-type "
"Alias, or a %4$sVirtual IP%5$s address."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ກົງກັບກົດລະບຽບນີ້ຈະຖືກແມັບກັບ %1$sທີ່ຢູ່%2$s ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້.%3$s%1$sທີ່ຢູ່%2$s ສາມາດເປັນອິນເຕີເຟສ, ນາມມະຍົດປະເພດໂຮສ, ຫຼືທີ່ຢູ່ %4$sVirtual IP%5$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:574
msgid "Other subnet"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍອື່ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:577
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This subnet must be routed to the firewall or each address in the subnet "
"must be defined in one or more %1$sVirtual IP%2$s addresses."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟວໍ ຫຼືແຕ່ລະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນທີ່ຢູ່ %1$sVirtual IP%2$s ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼືຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:586
msgid "Round Robin"
msgstr "Round Robin"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:587
msgid "Round Robin with Sticky Address"
msgstr "Round Robin ພ້ອມທີ່ຢູ່ Sticky"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:588
msgid "Random"
msgstr "ສຸ່ມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:589
msgid "Random with Sticky Address"
msgstr "ສຸ່ມພ້ອມທີ່ຢູ່ Sticky"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:590
msgid "Source hash"
msgstr "Source hash"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:591
msgid "Bit mask"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກບິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:582
msgid "Pool options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກພູລ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:594
msgid ""
"Only Round Robin types work with Host Aliases. Any type can be used with a "
"Subnet."
msgstr "ມີພຽງປະເພດ Round Robin ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບນາມມະຍົດໂຮສ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:596
msgid "Round Robin: Loops through the translation addresses."
msgstr "Round Robin: ວົນຜ່ານທີ່ຢູ່ການແປ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:597
msgid ""
"Random: Selects an address from the translation address pool at random."
msgstr "ສຸ່ມ: ເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ຈາກພູລທີ່ຢູ່ການແປແບບສຸ່ມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:598
msgid ""
"Source Hash: Uses a hash of the source address to determine the translation "
"address, ensuring that the redirection address is always the same for a "
"given source."
msgstr "Source Hash: ໃຊ້ hash ຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ແຫຼ່ງເພື່ອກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ການແປ, ຮັບປະກັນວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງແມ່ນຄືກັນສະເໝີສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:599
msgid ""
"Bitmask: Applies the subnet mask and keeps the last portion identical; 10.0."
"1.50 -&gt; x.x.x.50."
msgstr "Bitmask: ນຳໃຊ້ໜ້າກາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍ ແລະຮັກສາສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ຄືກັນ; 10.0.1.50 -&gt; x.x.x.50."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:600
msgid ""
"Sticky Address: The Sticky Address option can be used with the Random and "
"Round Robin pool types to ensure that a particular source address is always "
"mapped to the same translation address."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ Sticky: ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ Sticky ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບປະເພດພູລສຸ່ມ ແລະ Round Robin ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ແຫຼ່ງສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກແມັບກັບທີ່ຢູ່ການແປດຽວກັນສະເໝີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:605
msgid "Source Hash Key"
msgstr "ຄີ Source Hash"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:608
msgid ""
"The key that is fed to the hashing algorithm in hex format, preceeded by "
"\"0x\", or any string. A non-hex string is hashed using md5 to a hexadecimal "
"key. Defaults to a randomly generated value."
msgstr "ຄີທີ່ຖືກປ້ອນໃຫ້ກັບອັລກໍຣິທຶມ hashing ໃນຮູບແບບເລກຖານສິບຫົກ, ນຳໜ້າດ້ວຍ \"0x\", ຫຼືສະຕຣິງໃດໆ. ສະຕຣິງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເລກຖານສິບຫົກຖືກ hashed ໂດຍໃຊ້ md5 ເປັນຄີເລກຖານສິບຫົກ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສ້າງແບບສຸ່ມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:618
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Enter the external source %1$sPort or Range%2$s used for remapping the "
"original source port on connections matching the rule. %3$sPort ranges are a "
"low port and high port number separated by \":\".%4$sLeave blank when "
"%1$sStatic Port%2$s is checked."
msgstr "ປ້ອນແຫຼ່ງພາຍນອກ %1$sພອດ ຫຼືຂອບເຂດ%2$s ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແມັບພອດແຫຼ່ງເດີມຄືນໃໝ່ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ກົງກັບກົດລະບຽບ. %3$sຂອບເຂດພອດແມ່ນພອດຕ່ຳ ແລະເລກພອດສູງທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍ \":\".%4$sປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເມື່ອ %1$sພອດສະຖິດ%2$s ຖືກກວດສອບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:633
msgid "Misc"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:641
msgid ""
"Prevents the rule on Master from automatically syncing to other CARP members."
" This does NOT prevent the rule from being overwritten on Slave."
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ກົດລະບຽບໃນ Master ຊິງຄ໌ກັບສະມາຊິກ CARP ອື່ນໆໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ກົດລະບຽບຖືກຂຽນທັບໃນ Slave."

