msgstr "ລຶບຄີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:82
msgid ""
"A valid IP address must be specified, or # for an exclusion or ! to not "
"forward at all."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຫຼື # ສຳລັບການຍົກເວັ້ນ ຫຼື ! ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ເລີຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:86
msgid "An interface IP address must be specified for the DNS query source."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP ອິນເຕີເຟສສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງຄຳຖາມ DNS."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:127
msgid "Domain Override Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຂຽນທັບໂດເມນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:134
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Domain to override (NOTE: this does not have to be a valid TLD!)%1$se.g.: "
"test or nas.home.arpa or mycompany.localdomain or 1.168.192.in-addr.arpa"
msgstr "ໂດເມນທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບ (ໝາຍເຫດ: ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນ TLD ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ!)%1$sຕົວຢ່າງ: test ຫຼື nas.home.arpa ຫຼື mycompany.localdomain ຫຼື 1.168.192.in-addr.arpa"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:142
#, php-format
msgid ""
"IP address of the authoritative DNS server for this domain%1$se.g.: 192.168."
"100.100%1$sOr enter # for an exclusion to pass through this host/subdomain "
"to standard nameservers instead of a previous override.%1$sOr enter ! for "
"lookups for this host/subdomain to NOT be forwarded anywhere."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີບເວີ DNS ທີ່ມີສິດອຳນາດສຳລັບໂດເມນນີ້%1$sຕົວຢ່າງ: 192.168.100.100%1$sຫຼືປ້ອນ # ສຳລັບການຍົກເວັ້ນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜ່ານໂຮສ/ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍນີ້ໄປຫາ nameservers ມາດຕະຖານແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຂຽນທັບກ່ອນໜ້າ.%1$sຫຼືປ້ອນ ! ສຳລັບການຊອກຫາໂຮສ/ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍນີ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປໃສເລີຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:149
msgid "Source IP"
msgstr "IP ແຫຼ່ງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq_domainoverride_edit.php:151
msgid ""
"Source IP address for queries to the DNS server for the override domain. "
"Leave blank unless the DNS server is accessed through a VPN tunnel."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແຫຼ່ງສຳລັບຄຳຖາມໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ DNS ສຳລັບໂດເມນຂຽນທັບ. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າເຊີບເວີ DNS ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານອຸໂມງ VPN."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "Renewed %s %s (%s) - Serial %s -> %s"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ %s %s (%s) ແລ້ວ - ເລກລຳດັບ %s -> %s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:87
msgid "Error renewing"
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:91
#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:104
msgid "Renew or Reissue"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ ຫຼືອອກໃໝ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:123
msgid ""
"Renewing or reissuing a CA or certificate will replace the old entry. The "
"old entry will be lost, and cannot be revoked after it has been replaced. "
"Daemons known to be using this entry or one of its descendents will be "
"restarted after the entry is replaced."
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ ຫຼືອອກໃໝ່ CA ຫຼືໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະປ່ຽນແທນລາຍການເກົ່າ. ລາຍການເກົ່າຈະສູນເສຍໄປ, ແລະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກເພິກຖອນໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມັນຖືກປ່ຽນແທນ. Daemons ທີ່ຮູ້ວ່າໃຊ້ລາຍການນີ້ ຫຼືລາຍການສືບທອດຂອງມັນຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກລາຍການຖືກປ່ຽນແທນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:131
msgid "Renew or Reissue: "
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ ຫຼືອອກໃໝ່: "

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:145
msgid "Subject Key ID"
msgstr "ID ຄີຫົວເລື່ອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:159
msgid "Issued By"
msgstr "ອອກໂດຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:166
msgid "Reuse Key"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄີຄືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:169
msgid ""
"Set this option to retain the existing keys when reissuing. Uncheck to "
"generate a new key."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເມື່ອອອກໃໝ່. ຍົກເລີກການກວດສອບເພື່ອສ້າງຄີໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:173
msgid "Strict Security"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:176
msgid ""
"Set this option to enforce stricter security requirements, which may alter "
"certain certificate properties such as the digest, key length, and lifetime. "
"Note that this will override the value of Reuse Key if the old key does not "
"meet the stricter requirements."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນບາງຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: digest, ຄວາມຍາວຄີ, ແລະອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ. ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຂຽນທັບຄ່າຂອງໃຊ້ຄີຄືນຖ້າຄີເກົ່າບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດກວ່າ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:197
msgid "Renew/Reissue"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ/ອອກໃໝ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:205
msgid "Certificate Properties vs Strict Security"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທຽບກັບຄວາມປອດໄພເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:209
msgid ""
"If Strict Security is checked, weak certificate properties will be replaced "
"as necessary."
