"portal, but rather how many connections a single IP can establish to the "
"portal web server."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນກັບເຊີບເວີ captive portal HTTP(S). ນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ captive portal ໄດ້, ແຕ່ເປັນຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ IP ດຽວສາມາດສ້າງກັບເຊີບເວີເວັບພータルໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:569
msgid "Idle timeout (Minutes)"
msgstr "ເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (ນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:572
msgid ""
"Clients will be disconnected after this amount of inactivity. They may log "
"in again immediately, though. Leave this field blank for no idle timeout."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນໄລຍະນີ້. ເຂົາເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບອີກຄັ້ງທັນທີ. ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງນີ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:576
msgid "Hard timeout (Minutes)"
msgstr "ເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບັງຄັບ (ນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:579
msgid ""
"Clients will be disconnected after this amount of time, regardless of "
"activity. They may log in again immediately, though. Leave this field blank "
"for no hard timeout (not recommended unless an idle timeout is set)."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກໄລຍະເວລານີ້, ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ເຂົາເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບອີກຄັ້ງທັນທີ. ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງນີ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບັງຄັບ (ບໍ່ແນະນຳເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຕັ້ງເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:584
msgid "Traffic quota (Megabytes)"
msgstr "ໂຄຕ້າການຈະລາຈອນ (ເມກາໄບຕ໌)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:587
msgid ""
"Clients will be disconnected after exceeding this amount of traffic, "
"inclusive of both downloads and uploads. They may log in again immediately, "
"though. Leave this field blank for no traffic quota."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກເກີນຈຳນວນການຈະລາຈອນນີ້, ລວມທັງການດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະອັບໂຫຼດ. ເຂົາເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບອີກຄັ້ງທັນທີ. ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງນີ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໂຄຕ້າການຈະລາຈອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:592
msgid "Pass-through credits per MAC address."
msgstr "ເຄຣດິດ Pass-through ຕໍ່ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:595
msgid ""
"Allows passing through the captive portal without authentication a limited "
"number of times per MAC address. Once used up, the client can only log in "
"with valid credentials until the waiting period specified below has expired. "
"Recommended to set a hard timeout and/or idle timeout when using this for it "
"to be effective."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜ່ານ captive portal ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບສິດຈຳນວນຄັ້ງຈຳກັດຕໍ່ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໝົດແລ້ວ, ລູກຄ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການກວດສອບສິດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນຈົນກວ່າໄລຍະເວລារង់ຄອຍທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ໝົດອາຍຸ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບັງຄັບ ແລະ/ຫຼືເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເມື່ອໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:601
msgid "Waiting period to restore pass-through credits. (Hours)"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລារង់ຄອຍເພື່ອຟື້ນຟູເຄຣດິດ pass-through. (ຊົ່ວໂມງ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:604
msgid ""
"Clients will have their available pass-through credits restored to the "
"original count after this amount of time since using the first one. This "
"must be above 0 hours if pass-through credits are enabled."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າຈະມີເຄຣດິດ pass-through ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງພວກເຂົາຖືກຟື້ນຟູກັບຄືນເປັນຈຳນວນເດີມຫຼັງຈາກໄລຍະເວລານີ້ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ໃຊ້ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ນີ້ຕ້ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 0 ຊົ່ວໂມງຖ້າເຄຣດິດ pass-through ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:609
msgid "Reset waiting period"
msgstr "ຣີເຊັດໄລຍະເວລារង់ຄອຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:612
msgid ""
"If enabled, the waiting period is reset to the original duration if access "
"is attempted when all pass-through credits have already been exhausted."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໄລຍະເວລារង់ຄອຍຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນໄລຍະເວລາເດີມຖ້າພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງເມື່ອເຄຣດິດ pass-through ທັງໝົດໝົດແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:616
msgid "Logout popup window"
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບອອກຈາກລະບົບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:619
msgid ""
"If enabled, a popup window will appear when clients are allowed through the "
"captive portal. This allows clients to explicitly disconnect themselves "
"before the idle or hard timeout occurs."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລູກຄ້າຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜ່ານ captive portal. ນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວເອງຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງກ່ອນທີ່ເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ ຫຼືເວລາໝົດອາຍຸແບບບັງຄັບເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:624
msgid "Pre-authentication redirect URL"
msgstr "URL ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງກ່ອນການກວດສອບສິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:627
msgid ""
"Set a default redirection URL. Visitors will be redirected to this URL after "
"authentication only if the captive portal doesn't know where to redirect "
"them. This field will be accessible through $PORTAL_REDIRURL$ variable in "
"captiveportal's HTML pages."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າ captive portal ບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າຈະປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງພວກເຂົາໄປໃສ. ຟິວນີ້ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານຕົວແປ $PORTAL_REDIRURL$ ໃນໜ້າ HTML ຂອງ captiveportal."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:631
msgid "After authentication Redirection URL"
msgstr "URL ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຫຼັງຈາກການກວດສອບສິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:634
msgid ""
"Set a forced redirection URL. Clients will be redirected to this URL instead "
"of the one they initially tried to access after they've authenticated."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງ URL ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງແບບບັງຄັບ. ລູກຄ້າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ URL ທີ່ພວກເຂົາພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ພວກເຂົາໄດ້ກວດສອບສິດແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:638
msgid "Blocked MAC address redirect URL"
msgstr "URL ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ຖືກບລັອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:641
msgid ""
"Blocked MAC addresses will be redirected to this URL when attempting access."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ທີ່ຖືກບລັອກຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:646
#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:653
msgid "Preserve users database"
msgstr "ຮັກສາຖານຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:649
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If enabled, connected users won't be disconnected during a %s reboot. This "
"setting is not editable because High Availability is enabled."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຣີບູດ %s. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ເນື່ອງຈາກການມີຄວາມພ້ອມສູງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:656
#, php-format
msgid "If enabled, connected users won't be disconnected during a %s reboot."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຣີບູດ %s."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:661
msgid "Concurrent user logins"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຜູ້ໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:664
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Disabled: Do not allow concurrent logins per username or voucher."
"%1$sMultiple: No restrictions to the number of logins per username or "
"voucher will be applied.%1$sLast login: Only the most recent login per "
"username or voucher will be granted. Previous logins will be disconnected."
"%1$sFirst login: Only the first login per username or voucher will be "
"granted. Further login attempts using the username or voucher will not be "
"possible while an initial user is already active."
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ: ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບພ້ອມກັນຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼືບັດກຳນົດເວລາ.%1$sຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ: ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຕໍ່ຈຳນວນການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼືບັດກຳນົດເວລາຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້.%1$sການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ: ມີພຽງການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຫຼ້າສຸດຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼືບັດກຳນົດເວລາເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບກ່ອນໜ້າຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.%1$sການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄັ້ງທຳອິດ: ມີພຽງການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄັ້ງທຳອິດຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼືບັດກຳນົດເວລາເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. ການພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເພີ່ມເຕີມໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼືບັດກຳນົດເວລາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຍັງເຄື່ອນໄຫວຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:673
msgid "MAC filtering"
msgstr "ການກັ່ນຕອງ MAC"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:676
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If enabled no attempts will be made to ensure that the MAC address of "
"clients stays the same while they are logged in. This is required when the "
"MAC address of the client cannot be determined (usually because there are "
"routers between %s and the clients). If this is enabled, RADIUS MAC "
"authentication cannot be used."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ຈະບໍ່ມີການພະຍາຍາມຮັບປະກັນວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ຂອງລູກຄ້າຄົງທີ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກເຂົາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕ້ອງການເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ຂອງລູກຄ້າໄດ້ (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິເນື່ອງຈາກມີເຣົາເຕີລະຫວ່າງ %s ແລະລູກຄ້າ). ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການກວດສອບສິດ RADIUS MAC ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:682
msgid "Pass-through MAC Auto Entry"
msgstr "ການປ້ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ MAC Pass-through"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:685
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, a MAC passthrough entry is automatically added after the user "
"has successfully authenticated. Users of that MAC address will never have to "
"authenticate again. To remove the passthrough MAC entry either log in and "
"remove it manually from the %1$sMAC tab%2$s or send a POST from another "
"system. If this is enabled, the logout window will not be shown."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ລາຍການ MAC passthrough ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກວດສອບສິດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບສິດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ເພື່ອລຶບລາຍການ MAC passthrough ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລະລຶບມັນອອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈາກແຖບ %1$sMAC%2$s ຫຼືສົ່ງ POST ຈາກລະບົບອື່ນ. ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໜ້າຕ່າງອອກຈາກລະບົບຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:692
msgid "Per-user bandwidth restriction"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດແບນວິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:699
msgid "Default download (Kbit/s)"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Kbit/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:706
msgid "Default upload (Kbit/s)"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Kbit/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:709
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the captive portal will restrict each user who logs "
"in to the specified default bandwidth. RADIUS servers can override the "
"default settings. Leave empty for no limit."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງ, captive portal ຈະຈຳກັດຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນທີ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບກັບແບນວິດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ສາມາດຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຂີດຈຳກັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:714
msgid "Use custom captive portal page"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໜ້າ captive portal ແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:717
msgid ""
"If set a portal.html page must be created and uploaded. If unchecked the "
"default template will be used"
msgstr "ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້ ຕ້ອງສ້າງ ແລະອັບໂຫຼດໜ້າ portal.html. ຖ້າບໍ່ກວດສອບ ຈະໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:721
msgid "HTML Page Contents"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນໜ້າ HTML"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:726
msgid "Portal page contents"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນໜ້າພータル"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:729
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Upload an HTML/PHP file for the portal page here (leave blank to keep the "
"current one). Make sure to include a form (POST to \"$PORTAL_ACTION$\") with "
"a submit button (name=\"accept\") and a hidden field with name=\"redirurl\" "
"and value=\"$PORTAL_REDIRURL$\". Include the \"auth_user\" and \"auth_pass\" "
"and/or \"auth_voucher\" input fields if authentication is enabled, otherwise "
"it will always fail.%1$sExample code for the form: %1$s&lt;form method="
"&quot;post&quot; action="
"&quot;$PORTAL_ACTION$&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;auth_user&quot; type="
"&quot;text&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;auth_pass&quot; type="
"&quot;password&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;auth_voucher&quot; type="
"&quot;text&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;redirurl&quot; type=&quot;hidden&quot; value="
"&quot;$PORTAL_REDIRURL$&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;zone&quot; type=&quot;hidden&quot; value="
"&quot;$PORTAL_ZONE$&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;accept&quot; type=&quot;submit&quot; value="
"&quot;Continue&quot;&gt;%1$s&lt;/form&gt;"
msgstr ""
"ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ HTML/PHP ສໍາລັບໜ້າປະຕູທີ່ນີ້ (ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາອັນປັດຈຸບັນ). ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະລວມເອົາແບບຟອມ (POST ຫາ \"$PORTAL_ACTION$\") ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມສົ່ງ (name=\"accept\") ແລະຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ດ້ວຍ name=\"redirurl\" ແລະ value=\"$PORTAL_REDIRURL$\". ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ \"auth_user\" ແລະ \"auth_pass\" ແລະ/ຫຼື \"auth_voucher\" ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະລົ້ມເຫລວສະເໝີ.%1$sຕົວຢ່າງລະຫັດສໍາລັບແບບຟອມ: %1$s&lt;form method="
"&quot;post&quot; action="
"&quot;$PORTAL_ACTION$&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;auth_user&quot; type="
"&quot;text&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;auth_pass&quot; type="
"&quot;password&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;auth_voucher&quot; type="
"&quot;text&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;redirurl&quot; type=&quot;hidden&quot; value="
"&quot;$PORTAL_REDIRURL$&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;zone&quot; type=&quot;hidden&quot; value="
"&quot;$PORTAL_ZONE$&quot;&gt;%1$s&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;input name="
"&quot;accept&quot; type=&quot;submit&quot; value="
"&quot;Continue&quot;&gt;%1$s&lt;/form&gt;"

