msgid ""
"The selected ECDSA certificate does not use a curve compatible with IKEv2"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ECDSA ທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ IKEv2"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:503
msgid ""
"The selected certificate contains wildcard entries, which are not supported."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເລືອກມີລາຍການ wildcard, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:507
msgid ""
"The selected certificate must be a Server Certificate for Mobile IPsec mode."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເລືອກຕ້ອງເປັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີສໍາລັບໂໝດ Mobile IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:642
msgid "Saved IPsec tunnel Phase 1 configuration."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPsec tunnel Phase 1 ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:670
