msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: Blowfish, 3DES, CAST128, MD5, SHA1, ແລະກຸ່ມ DH 1, 2, 5, 22, 23, ແລະ 24 ໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ອ່ອນແອ ແລະຄວນຫຼີກລ່ຽງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:987
msgid "Add Algorithm"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ Algorithm"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:996
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:764
msgid "Expiration and Replacement"
msgstr "ການໝົດອາຍຸ ແລະການປ່ຽນແທນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1000
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:768
msgid "Life Time"
msgstr "ເວລາຊີວິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1004
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hard IKE SA life time, in seconds, after which the IKE SA will be expired. "
"Must be larger than Rekey Time and Reauth Time. Cannot be set to the same "
"value as Rekey Time or Reauth Time. If left empty, defaults to 110% of "
"whichever timer is higher (reauth or rekey)"
msgstr "ເວລາຊີວິດ IKE SA ແຂງ, ເປັນວິນາທີ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ IKE SA ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ. ຕ້ອງໃຫຍ່ກວ່າເວລາ Rekey ແລະເວລາ Reauth. ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ມີຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບເວລາ Rekey ຫຼືເວລາ Reauth. ຖ້າປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 110% ຂອງຕົວຈັບເວລາໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ສູງກວ່າ (reauth ຫຼື rekey)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1011
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:780
msgid "Rekey Time"
msgstr "ເວລາ Rekey"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1015
msgid ""
"Time, in seconds, before an IKE SA establishes new keys. This works without "
"interruption. Cannot be set to the same value as Life Time. Only supported "
"by IKEv2, and is recommended for use with IKEv2. Leave blank to use a "
"default value of 90% Life Time when using IKEv2. Enter a value of 0 to "
"disable."
msgstr "ເວລາ, ເປັນວິນາທີ, ກ່ອນທີ່ IKE SA ຈະສ້າງຄີໃໝ່. ນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຂັດຂວາງ. ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ມີຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບເວລາຊີວິດໄດ້. ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ IKEv2 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະແນະນໍາໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກັບ IKEv2. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ 90% ເວລາຊີວິດເມື່ອໃຊ້ IKEv2. ໃສ່ຄ່າ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1023
msgid "Reauth Time"
msgstr "ເວລາ Reauth"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1027
msgid ""
"Time, in seconds, before an IKE SA is torn down and recreated from scratch, "
"including authentication. This can be disruptive unless both sides support "
"make-before-break and overlapping IKE SA entries. Cannot be set to the same "
"value as Life Time. Supported by IKEv1 and IKEv2. Leave blank to use a "
"default value of 90% Life Time when using IKEv1. Enter a value of 0 to "
"disable."
msgstr "ເວລາ, ເປັນວິນາທີ, ກ່ອນທີ່ IKE SA ຈະຖືກທໍາລາຍ ແລະສ້າງໃໝ່ຈາກຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ລວມທັງການກວດສອບ. ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນການລົບກວນເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າທັງສອງຝ່າຍສະໜັບສະໜູນ make-before-break ແລະລາຍການ IKE SA ທີ່ຊໍ້າກັນ. ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ມີຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບເວລາຊີວິດໄດ້. ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ IKEv1 ແລະ IKEv2. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ 90% ເວລາຊີວິດເມື່ອໃຊ້ IKEv1. ໃສ່ຄ່າ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1036
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:793
msgid "Rand Time"
msgstr "ເວລາ Rand"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1040
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A random value up to this amount will be subtracted from Rekey Time/Reauth "
"Time to avoid simultaneous renegotiation. If left empty, defaults to 10% of "
"Life Time. Enter 0 to disable randomness, but be aware that simultaneous "
"renegotiation can lead to duplicate security associations."
msgstr "ຄ່າສຸ່ມສູງສຸດເທົ່າກັບຈໍານວນນີ້ຈະຖືກຫັກອອກຈາກເວລາ Rekey/ເວລາ Reauth ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເຈລະຈາໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັນ. ຖ້າປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 10% ຂອງເວລາຊີວິດ. ໃສ່ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານຄວາມສຸ່ມ, ແຕ່ຄວນລະວັງວ່າການເຈລະຈາໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັນສາມາດນໍາໄປສູ່ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຊໍ້າກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1050
msgid "Responder Only"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຕອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1057
msgid "Child SA Close Action"
msgstr "ການກະທຳປິດ Child SA"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1060
msgid ""
"Set this option to control the behavior when the remote peer unexpectedly "
"closes a child SA (P2)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມພຶດຕິກໍາເມື່ອເພື່ອນຣີໂໝດປິດ Child SA (P2) ໂດຍບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1066
msgid "Force"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1064
msgid "NAT Traversal"
msgstr "ການຂ້າມ NAT"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1067
msgid ""
"Set this option to enable the use of NAT-T (i.e. the encapsulation of ESP in "
"UDP packets) if needed, which can help with clients that are behind "
"restrictive firewalls."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການໃຊ້ NAT-T (ເຊັ່ນ: ການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ ESP ໃນແພັກເກັດ UDP) ຖ້າຈໍາເປັນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຊ່ວຍລູກຄ້າທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງໄຟວໍທີ່ຈໍາກັດໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1072
msgid "MOBIKE"
msgstr "MOBIKE"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1075
msgid "Set this option to control the use of MOBIKE"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການໃຊ້ MOBIKE"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1080
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Enable this to allow multiple phase 1 configurations with the same endpoint. "
"When enabled, %s does not manage routing to the remote gateway and traffic "
"will follow the default route without regard for the chosen interface. "
"Static routes can override this behavior."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ phase 1 ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ມີຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍດຽວກັນ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, %s ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດການເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາເກດເວຣີໂໝດຣີໂໝດ ແລະການຈະລາຈອນຈະຕິດຕາມເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຄໍານຶງເຖິງອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ເລືອກ. ເສັ້ນທາງສະຖິດສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກໍານີ້ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1079
msgid "Gateway duplicates"
msgstr "ການຊໍ້າກັນຂອງເກດເວຣີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1088
msgid "Split connections"
msgstr "ແຍກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1095
msgid "PRF Selection"
msgstr "ການເລືອກ PRF"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1098
msgid ""
"Manual PRF selection is typically not required, but can be useful in "
"combination with AEAD Encryption Algorithms such as AES-GCM"
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວການເລືອກ PRF ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງບໍ່ຈໍາເປັນ, ແຕ່ສາມາດເປັນປະໂຫຍດໃນການສົມທົບກັບ AEAD Encryption Algorithms ເຊັ່ນ AES-GCM"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1100
