msgid "VTI requires a valid remote address"
msgstr ""
"VTI ຕ້ອງການທີ່ຢູ່ຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:232
msgid "An IPv4 remote network was specified but the mode is not set to tunnel"
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ລະບຸເຄືອຂ່າຍຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກ IPv4 ແຕ່ໂໝດບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:234
msgid ""
"An IPv6 remote network was specified but the mode is not set to tunnel6"
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ລະບຸເຄືອຂ່າຍຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກ IPv6 ແຕ່ໂໝດບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ tunnel6"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:243
msgid "VTI is not compatible with mobile IPsec."
msgstr ""
"VTI ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບ mobile IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:264
msgid "Phase2 with this Local Network is already defined for mobile clients."
msgstr ""
"Phase2 ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນນີ້ຖືກກໍານົດໄວ້ແລ້ວສໍາລັບລູກຄ້າມືຖື."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:297
msgid ""
"Phase2 with this Local/Remote networks combination is already defined for "
"this Phase1."
msgstr ""
"Phase2 ກັບການປະສົມປະສານເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນ/ຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກນີ້ຖືກກໍານົດໄວ້ແລ້ວສໍາລັບ Phase1 ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:308
msgid ""
"Cannot switch away from VTI while the interface is assigned. Remove the "
"interface assignment before switching away from VTI."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຈາກ VTI ໃນຂະນະທີ່ອິນເຕີເຟດຖືກມອບໝາຍ. ລົບການມອບໝາຍອິນເຕີເຟດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນຈາກ VTI."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:343
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:348
msgid ""
"The local and remote networks of a phase 2 entry cannot overlap the outside "
"of the tunnel (interface and remote gateway) configured in its phase 1."
msgstr ""
"ເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນແລະຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກຂອງລາຍການ phase 2 ບໍ່ສາມາດທັບຊ້ອນກັບພາຍນອກຂອງອຸໂມງ (ອິນເຕີເຟດແລະ gateway ຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກ) ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ phase 1 ຂອງມັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:362
msgid "At least one encryption algorithm must be selected."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງເລືອກສູດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:367
msgid "At least one hashing algorithm needs to be selected."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງເລືອກສູດການ hashing ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:380
msgid "Life Time cannot be set to the same value as Rekey Time."
msgstr ""
"Life Time ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ Rekey Time."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:383
msgid "Life Time must be larger than Rekey Time."
msgstr ""
"Life Time ຕ້ອງໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ Rekey Time."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:479
msgid "Saved IPsec tunnel Phase 2 configuration."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPsec tunnel Phase 2 ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:494
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:498
msgid "Edit Phase 2"
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂ Phase 2"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:602
msgid "*Local Network"
msgstr ""
"*ເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:626
msgid "NAT/BINAT translation"
msgstr ""
"ການແປ NAT/BINAT"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:650
msgid ""
"If NAT/BINAT is required on this network specify the address to be "
"translated"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ NAT/BINAT ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຈະແປ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:654
msgid "*Remote Network"
msgstr ""
"*ເຄືອຂ່າຍຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:683
msgid "Phase 2 Proposal (SA/Key Exchange)"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ສະເໜີ Phase 2 (SA/Key Exchange)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:690
msgid ""
"Encapsulating Security Payload (ESP) is encryption, Authentication Header "
"(AH) is authentication only."
msgstr ""
"Encapsulating Security Payload (ESP) ແມ່ນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ, Authentication Header (AH) ແມ່ນການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:696
msgid "*Encryption Algorithms"
msgstr ""
"*ສູດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:727
msgid ""
"Note: Blowfish, 3DES, and CAST128 provide weak security and should be "
"avoided."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: Blowfish, 3DES, ແລະ CAST128 ໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພອ່ອນແອ ແລະຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:734
msgid "*Hash Algorithms"
msgstr ""
"*ສູດການ Hash"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:746
msgid ""
"Note: Hash is ignored with GCM algorithms. MD5 and SHA1 provide weak "
"security and should be avoided."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: Hash ຖືກລະເລີຍກັບສູດການ GCM. MD5 ແລະ SHA1 ໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພອ່ອນແອ ແລະຄວນຫຼີກເວັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:757
msgid "PFS key group"
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມລະຫັດ PFS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:772
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Hard Child SA life time, in seconds, after which the Child SA will be "
"expired. Must be larger than Rekey Time. Cannot be set to the same value as "
"Rekey Time. If left empty, defaults to 110% of Rekey Time. If both Life Time "
"and Rekey Time are empty, defaults to 3960."
msgstr ""
"ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ Hard Child SA, ເປັນວິນາທີ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ Child SA ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ. ຕ້ອງໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ Rekey Time. ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ Rekey Time. ຖ້າປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 110% ຂອງ Rekey Time. ຖ້າທັງ Life Time ແລະ Rekey Time ຫວ່າງ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 3960."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:784
msgid ""
"Time, in seconds, before a Child SA establishes new keys. This works without "
"interruption. Cannot be set to the same value as Life Time. Leave blank to "
"use a default value of 90% Life Time. If both Life Time and Rekey Time are "
"empty, defaults to 3600. Enter a value of 0 to disable, but be aware that "
"when rekey is disabled, connections can be interrupted while new Child SA "
"entries are negotiated."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາ, ເປັນວິນາທີ, ກ່ອນທີ່ Child SA ຈະສ້າງລະຫັດໃໝ່. ນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຂັດຂວາງ. ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບ Life Time. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 90% ຂອງ Life Time. ຖ້າທັງ Life Time ແລະ Rekey Time ຫວ່າງ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 3600. ປ້ອນຄ່າ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ແຕ່ຄວນລະວັງວ່າເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ rekey, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອາດຈະຖືກຂັດຂວາງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຈລະຈາລາຍການ Child SA ໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:797
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A random value up to this amount will be subtracted from Rekey Time to avoid "
"simultaneous renegotiation. If left empty, defaults to 10% of Life Time. "
"Enter 0 to disable randomness, but be aware that simultaneous renegotiation "
"can lead to duplicate security associations."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແບບສຸ່ມສູງສຸດເຖິງຈໍານວນນີ້ຈະຖືກຫັກອອກຈາກ Rekey Time ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເຈລະຈາຄືນພ້ອມກັນ. ຖ້າປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10% ຂອງ Life Time. ປ້ອນ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານຄວາມສຸ່ມ, ແຕ່ຄວນລະວັງວ່າການເຈລະຈາຄືນພ້ອມກັນສາມາດນໍາໄປສູ່ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄວາມປອດໄພຊໍ້າກັນ."

