#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:574
#, php-format
msgid "Sorry, an interface group with the name %s already exists."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍໂທດ, ກຸ່ມອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ມີຊື່ %s ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:580
msgid "The interface description cannot contain only numbers."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟດບໍ່ສາມາດມີຕົວເລກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:585
msgid ""
"The OpenVPN and VTI interface description must be less than 26 characters "
"long."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟດ OpenVPN ແລະ VTI ຕ້ອງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 26 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:590
msgid ""
"The GIF and GRE interface description must be less than 23 characters long."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟດ GIF ແລະ GRE ຕ້ອງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 23 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:599
msgid "The interface description cannot start with pkg_"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟດບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ pkg_"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:609
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In order to block bogon networks the Firewall Maximum Table Entries value in "
"System / Advanced / Firewall must be increased at least to %s."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍ bogon, ຄ່າ Firewall Maximum Table Entries ໃນ ລະບົບ / ຂັ້ນສູງ / Firewall ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເປັນ %s."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:615
msgid ""
"The DHCP Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with a "
"static IP configuration. Please disable the DHCP Server service on this "
"interface first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີ DHCP ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ ແລະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IP ສະຖິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດການໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການເຊີບເວີ DHCP ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:621
msgid ""
"The DHCP Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with "
"IPv4 subnet < 31. Please disable the DHCP Server service on this interface "
"first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີ DHCP ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ ແລະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ IPv4 subnet < 31 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດການໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການເຊີບເວີ DHCP ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:630
msgid ""
"The DHCP6 Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with a "
"static IPv6 configuration. Please disable the DHCPv6 Server service on this "
"interface first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີ DHCP6 ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ ແລະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPv6 ສະຖິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດການໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການເຊີບເວີ DHCPv6 ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:635
msgid ""
"The Router Advertisements Server is active on this interface and it can be "
"used only with a static IPv6 configuration. Please disable the Router "
