msgid "6RD Prefix"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນຳໜ້າ 6RD"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2723
msgid "*6RD Border relay"
msgstr ""
"*6RD Border relay"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2730
msgid "6RD IPv4 Prefix length"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຄຳນຳໜ້າ 6RD IPv4"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2733
msgid ""
"6RD IPv4 prefix length. Normally specified by the ISP. A value of 0 means "
"embed the entire IPv4 address in the 6RD prefix."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍາວຄຳນຳໜ້າ 6RD IPv4. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນ ISP ລະບຸ. ຄ່າ 0 ໝາຍເຖິງການຝັງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ທັງໝົດໃນຄຳນຳໜ້າ 6RD."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2738
msgid "Track IPv6 Interface"
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕາມອິນເຕີເຟດ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2780
msgid "*IPv6 Interface"
msgstr ""
"*ອິນເຕີເຟດ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2783
msgid "Selects the dynamic IPv6 WAN interface to track for configuration."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟດ WAN IPv6 ແບບໄດນາມິກເພື່ອຕິດຕາມສໍາລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2791
msgid "IPv6 Prefix ID"
msgstr ""
"ID ຄຳນຳໜ້າ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2794
#, php-format
msgid ""
"(%1$shexadecimal%2$s from 0 to %3$s) The value in this field is the "
"(Delegated) IPv6 prefix ID. This determines the configurable network ID "
"based on the dynamic IPv6 connection. The default value is 0."
msgstr ""
"(%1$shexadecimal%2$s ຈາກ 0 ຫາ %3$s) ຄ່າໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ແມ່ນ ID ຄຳນຳໜ້າ IPv6 (ທີ່ມອບໝາຍ). ນີ້ຈະກໍານົດ ID ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ IPv6 ແບບໄດນາມິກ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2851
msgid "Typically *99# for GSM networks and #777 for CDMA networks."
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ *99# ສໍາລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ GSM ແລະ #777 ສໍາລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ CDMA."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2855
msgid "Access Point Name"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຈຸດເຂົ້າເຖິງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2881
msgid "*Modem port"
msgstr ""
"*ພອດໂມເດັມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2888
msgid "Advanced PPP"
msgstr ""
"PPP ຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2891
msgid "Create a new PPP configuration."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PPP ໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2896
msgid "PPPoE Configuration"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PPPoE"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2919
msgid "This field can usually be left empty."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2923
msgid "Host-Uniq"
msgstr ""
"Host-Uniq"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2926
msgid ""
"A unique host tag value for this PPPoE client. Leave blank unless a value is "
"required by the service provider."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແທັກໂຮສທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກສໍາລັບລູກຄ້າ PPPoE ນີ້. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເວັ້ນແຕ່ຄ່າຈະຖືກຕ້ອງການໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2938
msgid "Idle timeout"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາໝົດກຳນົດບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2942 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3089
msgid ""
"If no qualifying outgoing packets are transmitted for the specified number "
"of seconds, the connection is brought down. An idle timeout of zero disables "
"this feature."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດຂາອອກທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຖືກສົ່ງໄປເປັນຈໍານວນວິນາທີທີ່ກໍານົດ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຖືກປິດລົງ. ເວລາໝົດກຳນົດບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກເປັນສູນຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2947
msgid "Periodic reset"
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດເປັນໄລຍະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2950
msgid "Select a reset timing type."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກປະເພດເວລາຣີເຊັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2952
msgid "Custom reset"
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2961
msgid "Hour (0-23)"
msgstr ""
"ຊົ່ວໂມງ (0-23)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2969
msgid "Minutes (0-59)"
msgstr ""
"ນາທີ (0-59)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2976
msgid "Specific date (mm/dd/yyyy)"
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີສະເພາະ (mm/dd/yyyy)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2978
msgid ""
"Leave the date field empty, for the reset to be executed each day at the "
"time specified by the minutes and hour fields"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນວັນທີຫວ່າງໄວ້, ສໍາລັບການຣີເຊັດທີ່ຈະດໍາເນີນການທຸກໆມື້ໃນເວລາທີ່ກໍານົດໂດຍຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນນາທີແລະຊົ່ວໂມງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2982
msgid "cron based reset"
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດໂດຍອີງໃສ່ cron"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3021 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3100
msgid "Advanced and MLPPP"
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນສູງ ແລະ MLPPP"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3024
msgid ""
"Click for additional PPPoE configuration options. Save first if changes have "
"been made."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກສໍາລັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PPPoE ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ບັນທຶກກ່ອນຖ້າໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3029
msgid "PPTP/L2TP Configuration"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PPTP/L2TP"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3062
msgid "*Local IP address"
msgstr ""
"*ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3069
msgid "*Remote IP address"
msgstr ""
"*ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3080
msgid ""
"This option causes the interface to operate in dial-on-demand mode, allowing "
"it to be a virtual full time connection. The interface is configured, but "
"the actual connection of the link is delayed until qualifying outgoing "
"traffic is detected."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ອິນເຕີເຟດເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ dial-on-demand, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ virtual ເຕັມເວລາ. ອິນເຕີເຟດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແຕ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕົວຈິງຂອງລິ້ງຈະຊັກຊ້າຈົນກວ່າຈະກວດພົບການຈະລາຈອນຂາອອກທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3085
msgid "Idle timeout (seconds)"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາໝົດກຳນົດບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ (ວິນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3093
msgid "There are additional Local and Remote IP addresses defined for MLPPP."
msgstr ""
"ມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະຫ່າງໄກສອກຫຼີກເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ກໍານົດໄວ້ສໍາລັບ MLPPP."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3103
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%sClick for additional PPTP and L2TP configuration options. Save first if "
"changes have been made."
msgstr ""
"%sຄລິກສໍາລັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PPTP ແລະ L2TP ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ບັນທຶກກ່ອນຖ້າໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ."

