msgid "Maximum number of pings"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ ping ສູງສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:164
msgid "Select the maximum number of pings."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຈຳນວນ ping ສູງສຸດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:168
msgid "Seconds between pings"
msgstr ""
"ວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງ pings"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:171
msgid "Select the number of seconds to wait between pings."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າລະຫວ່າງ pings."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:76
msgid "Certificate Expiration"
msgstr ""
"ການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:79
msgid ""
"When enabled, the firewall will check CA and Certificate expiration times "
"daily and file notices when expired or soon-to-expire entries are detected."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, firewall ຈະກວດສອບເວລາໝົດອາຍຸຂອງ CA ແລະໃບຢັ້ງຢືນປະຈໍາວັນ ແລະບັນທຶກການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອພົບເຫັນລາຍການທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ ຫຼືໃກ້ໝົດອາຍຸ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:84
msgid "Certificate Expiration Threshold"
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:88
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The number of days at which a certificate lifetime is considered to be "
"expiring soon and worthy of notification. Default is %d days."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນວັນທີ່ອາຍຸການใช้งานຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າໃກ້ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ ແລະຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ %d ວັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:94
msgid "E-Mail"
msgstr ""
"ອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:98
msgid "Disable SMTP"
msgstr ""
"ປິດໃຊ້ງານ SMTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:101
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable SMTP notifications but preserve the settings "
"below. Some other mechanisms, such as packages, may need these settings in "
"place to function."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ SMTP ແຕ່ຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂ້າງລຸ່ມ. ກົນໄກອື່ນໆ, ເຊັ່ນ: packages, ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:107
msgid "E-Mail server"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີບເວີອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:110
msgid ""
"This is the FQDN or IP address of the SMTP E-Mail server to which "
"notifications will be sent."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນ FQDN ຫຼືທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີບເວີອີເມວ SMTP ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:115
msgid "SMTP Port of E-Mail server"
msgstr ""
"ພອດ SMTP ຂອງເຊີບເວີອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:118
msgid ""
"This is the port of the SMTP E-Mail server, typically 25, 587 (submission) "
"or 465 (smtps)."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນພອດຂອງເຊີບເວີອີເມວ SMTP, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 25, 587 (ການສົ່ງ) ຫຼື 465 (smtps)."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:123
msgid "Connection timeout to E-Mail server"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາໝົດກຳນົດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:126
msgid ""
"This is how many seconds it will wait for the SMTP server to connect. "
"Default is 20s."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ມັນຈະລໍຖ້າເຊີບເວີ SMTP ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 20s."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:128
msgid "Secure SMTP Connection"
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SMTP ທີ່ປອດໄພ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:131
msgid "Enable SSL/TLS"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ SSL/TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:140
msgid "Validate SSL/TLS"
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ SSL/TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:143
msgid ""
"When disabled, the server certificate will not be validated. Encryption will "
"still be used if available, but the identity of the server will not be "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງເຊີບເວີຈະບໍ່ຖືກກວດສອບ. ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າມີ, ແຕ່ຕົວຕົນຂອງເຊີບເວີຈະບໍ່ຖືກຢືນຢັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:148
msgid "From e-mail address"
msgstr ""
"ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຈາກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:151
msgid "This is the e-mail address that will appear in the from field."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງຈາກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:155
msgid "Notification E-Mail address"
msgstr ""
"ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:158
msgid "Enter the e-mail address to send email notifications to."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວເພື່ອສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທາງອີເມວໄປຫາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:163
msgid "Notification E-Mail auth username (optional)"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ການກວດສອບອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (ທາງເລືອກ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:167
msgid "Enter the e-mail address username for SMTP authentication."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວສໍາລັບການກວດສອບ SMTP."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:171
msgid "Notification E-Mail auth password"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານການກວດສອບອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:175
msgid "Enter the e-mail account password for SMTP authentication."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານບັນຊີອີເມວສໍາລັບການກວດສອບ SMTP."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:179
msgid "Notification E-Mail auth mechanism"
msgstr ""
"ກົນໄກການກວດສອບອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:182
msgid ""
"Select the authentication mechanism used by the SMTP server. Most work with "
"PLAIN, some servers like Exchange or Office365 might require LOGIN. "
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກກົນໄກການກວດສອບທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເຊີບເວີ SMTP. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບ PLAIN, ບາງເຊີບເວີເຊັ່ນ Exchange ຫຼື Office365 ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ LOGIN."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:186
msgid "Test SMTP Settings"
msgstr ""
"ທົດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SMTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:189
msgid ""
"A test notification will be sent even if the service is marked as disabled.  "
"The last SAVED values will be used, not necessarily the values entered here."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທົດສອບຈະຖືກສົ່ງເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການບໍລິການຈະຖືກຫມາຍວ່າປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ຄ່າທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກໃຊ້, ບໍ່ຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າທີ່ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:194
msgid "Sounds"
msgstr ""
"ສຽງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:198
msgid "Startup/Shutdown Sound"
msgstr ""
"ສຽງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ/ປິດເຄື່ອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:201
msgid "When this is checked, startup and shutdown sounds will no longer play."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອອັນນີ້ຖືກກວດສອບ, ສຽງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລະປິດເຄື່ອງຈະບໍ່ດັງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:206
msgid "Telegram"
msgstr ""
"Telegram"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:210
msgid "Enable Telegram"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ Telegram"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:213
msgid ""
"Check this option to enable Telegram notifications. <br>You will need a "
"Telegram Bot and its associated API key. <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/"
"bots#creating-a-new-bot\" target=\"_blank\">Instructions here.</a>"
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Telegram. <br>ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງມີ Telegram Bot ແລະລະຫັດ API ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/"
"bots#creating-a-new-bot\" target=\"_blank\">ຄໍາແນະນໍາຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:217
#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:253
msgid "API Key"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດ API"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:221
msgid ""
"Enter the Bot API key required to authenticate with the Telegram API server."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນລະຫັດ API ຂອງ Bot ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຢືນຢັນກັບເຊີບເວີ Telegram API."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:225
msgid "Chat ID"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດສົນທະນາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:230
msgid ""
"Enter the chat ID number (private) or channel @username (public) that will "
"be used to send the notifications to."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກລະຫັດສົນທະນາ (ສ່ວນຕົວ) ຫຼື @ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ (ສາທາລະນະ) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:234
msgid "Test Telegram Settings"
msgstr ""
"ທົດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Telegram"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:237
#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:307
msgid ""
"A test notification will be sent even if the service is not enabled.  The "
"last SAVED values will be used, not necessarily the values displayed here."
msgstr ""
"ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທົດສອບຈະຖືກສົ່ງເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການບໍລິການຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ຄ່າທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກໃຊ້, ບໍ່ຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:242
msgid "Pushover"
msgstr ""
"Pushover"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:246
msgid "Enable Pushover"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ Pushover"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:249
msgid ""
"Check this option to enable Pushover notifications. <br>An API key will need "
"to be created and entered along with the Pushover account user key. <a href="
"\"https://pushover.net/api#registration\" target=\"_blank\">API "
"documentation.</a>"
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Pushover. <br>ລະຫັດ API ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂື້ນແລະປ້ອນເຂົ້າພ້ອມກັບລະຫັດຜູ້ໃຊ້ບັນຊີ Pushover. <a href="
"\"https://pushover.net/api#registration\" target=\"_blank\">ເອກະສານ API.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:257
msgid ""
"Enter the API key required to authenticate with the Pushover API server. <a "
"href=\"https://pushover.net/apps/build\" target=\"_blank\">Create API key "
"here.</a>"
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນລະຫັດ API ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຢືນຢັນກັບເຊີບເວີ Pushover API. <a "
"href=\"https://pushover.net/apps/build\" target=\"_blank\">ສ້າງລະຫັດ API ທີ່ນີ້.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:261
msgid "User Key"
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:266
msgid "Enter user key of the Pushover account"
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງບັນຊີ Pushover"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:270
msgid "Notification Sound"
msgstr ""
"ສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:273
msgid ""
"Select notification sound. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#sounds\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Notification Sound documentation with audio.</a>"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#sounds\" "
"target=\"_blank\">ເອກະສານສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນພ້ອມສຽງ.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:277
msgid "Message Priority"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສໍາຄັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:286
msgid ""
"Select message priority. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#priority\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Message Priority documentation.</a>"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຄວາມສໍາຄັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#priority\" "
"target=\"_blank\">ເອກະສານຄວາມສໍາຄັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:290
msgid "Emergency Priority Notification Retry Interval"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງການລອງໃໝ່ຂອງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຸກເສີນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:293
msgid ""
"This specifies how often (in seconds) the Pushover servers will send the "
"same notification for Emergency Priority notifications until the "
"notification is acknowledged. <br>This parameter must have a value of at "
"least 30 seconds between retries. Default is 1 minute."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ຈະກໍານົດວ່າເລື້ອຍໆ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ເຊີບເວີ Pushover ຈະສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນດຽວກັນສໍາລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຸກເສີນຈົນກວ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະຖືກຮັບຮູ້. <br>ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 30 ວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການລອງໃໝ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1 ນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:297
msgid "Emergency Priority Notification Expiration"
msgstr "ການໝົດອາຍຸການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຸກເສີນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:300
msgid ""
"This specifies how many seconds the notifications will continue to be "
"retried (every retry seconds) for Emergency Priority notifications until the "
"notification is acknowledged. <br>This parameter must have a maximum value "
"of at most 10800 seconds (3 hours). Default is 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ລະບຸຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະສືບຕໍ່ຖືກລອງໃໝ່ (ທຸກໆ retry ວິນາທີ) ສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຸກເສີນຈົນກວ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະຖືກຮັບຮູ້. <br>ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າສູງສຸດບໍ່ເກີນ 10800 ວິນາທີ (3 ຊົ່ວໂມງ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 5 ນາທີ."

