msgid "%s is not valid source IP address for\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t       \tIPsec bypass rule"
msgstr "%s ບໍ່ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t       \tກົດລະບຽບການຂ້າມຜ່ານ IPsec"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:96
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not valid destination IP address \n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tfor IPsec bypass rule"
msgstr "%s ບໍ່ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈຸດໝາຍປາຍທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tສຳລັບກົດລະບຽບການຂ້າມຜ່ານ IPsec"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:101
msgid ""
"IPsec bypass source and destination addresses\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tmust belong to the same IP family."
msgstr ""
"ທີ່ຢູ່ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ ແລະ ຈຸດໝາຍປາຍທາງຂອງ IPsec bypass\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນກັບຄອບຄົວ IP ດຽວກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:282
msgid "Saved IPsec advanced settings."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນສູງ IPsec ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:349
msgid "IPsec Logging Controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມການບັນທຶກ IPsec"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:361
msgid ""
"Changes the log verbosity for the IPsec daemon, so that more detail will be "
"generated to aid in troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງບັນທຶກສຳລັບ IPsec daemon, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:366
msgid "Advanced IPsec Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPsec ຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:370
msgid "Configure Unique IDs as"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Unique IDs ເປັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:374
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Whether a particular participant ID should be kept unique, with any new "
"IKE_SA using an ID deemed to replace all old ones using that ID. Participant "
"IDs normally are unique, so a new IKE_SA using the same ID is almost "
"invariably intended to replace an old one. The difference between %1$sno%2$s "
"and %1$snever%2$s is that the old IKE_SAs will be replaced when receiving an "
"INITIAL_CONTACT notify if the option is no but will ignore these notifies if "
"%1$snever%2$s is configured. The daemon also accepts the value %1$skeep%2$s "
"to reject new IKE_SA setups and keep the duplicate established earlier. "
"Defaults to Yes."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າ ID ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຄວນຖືກຮັກສາເປັນເອກະລັກ, ໂດຍ IKE_SA ໃໝ່ໃດໆທີ່ໃຊ້ ID ທີ່ຖືວ່າຈະປ່ຽນແທນອັນເກົ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ ID ນັ້ນ. ID ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນເປັນເອກະລັກ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ IKE_SA ໃໝ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ ID ດຽວກັນແມ່ນມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອປ່ຽນແທນອັນເກົ່າສະເໝີ. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ %1$sno%2$s ແລະ %1$snever%2$s ແມ່ນວ່າ IKE_SAs ເກົ່າຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງ INITIAL_CONTACT ຖ້າຕົວເລືອກແມ່ນ no ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ສົນໃຈການແຈ້ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ %1$snever%2$s. daemon ຍັງຮັບຄ່າ %1$skeep%2$s ເພື່ອປະຕິເສດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IKE_SA ໃໝ່ ແລະຮັກສາສຳເນົາທີ່ສ້າງຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ Yes."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:386
msgid "IPsec Filter Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດຕົວກອງ IPsec"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:390
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Experimental. Controls how the firewall will filter IPsec traffic. By "
"default, rules on the IPsec tab filter all IPsec traffic, including both "
"tunnel mode and VTI mode. %3$sThis is limited in that it does not allow for "
"filtering on assigned VTI interfaces, and it does not support features such "
"as NAT rules and reply-to for return routing. When set to filter on assigned "
"VTI interfaces, %1$sall tunnel mode traffic is blocked%2$s. Do not set this "
"option unless %1$sall%2$s IPsec tunnels are using VTI."
msgstr ""
"ທົດລອງ. ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ໄຟວໍຈະກັ່ນຕອງການຈະລາຈອນ IPsec. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ກົດລະບຽບໃນແຖບ IPsec ກັ່ນຕອງການຈະລາຈອນ IPsec ທັງໝົດ, ລວມທັງໂໝດ tunnel ແລະ ໂໝດ VTI. %3$sນີ້ມີຂີດຈຳກັດໃນທີ່ມັນບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກັ່ນຕອງໃນອິນເຕີເຟດ VTI ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ແລະມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເຊັ່ນ: ກົດລະບຽບ NAT ແລະ reply-to ສຳລັບການສົ່ງເສັ້ນທາງກັບຄືນ. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັ່ນຕອງໃນອິນເຕີເຟດ VTI ທີ່ກຳນົດ, %1$sການຈະລາຈອນໂໝດ tunnel ທັງໝົດຖືກບລັອກ%2$s. ຢ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເວັ້ນແຕ່ %1$sອຸໂມງ IPsec ທັງໝົດ%2$s ໃຊ້ VTI."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:401
msgid "IP Compression"
msgstr "ການບີບອັດ IP"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:404
msgid "IPComp compression of content is proposed on the connection."
msgstr "ການບີບອັດ IPComp ຂອງເນື້ອຫາແມ່ນຖືກສະເໜີໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:408
#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:343
msgid "Strict interface binding"
msgstr "ການຜູກອິນເຕີເຟດຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:411
msgid ""
"Enable strongSwan's interfaces_use option to bind specific interfaces only. "
"This option is known to break IPsec with dynamic IP interfaces. This is not "
"recommended at this time."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກ interfaces_use ຂອງ strongSwan ເພື່ອຜູກອິນເຕີເຟດສະເພາະເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຮູ້ກັນວ່າຈະທຳລາຍ IPsec ດ້ວຍອິນເຕີເຟດ IP ແບບໄດນາມິກ. ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃນເວລານີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:415
msgid "Unencrypted payloads in IKEv1 Main Mode"
msgstr "payloads ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ IKEv1 Main Mode"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:419
msgid ""
"Some implementations send the third Main Mode message unencrypted, probably "
"to find the PSKs for the specified ID for authentication. This is very "
"similar to Aggressive Mode, and has the same security implications: A "
"passive attacker can sniff the negotiated Identity, and start brute forcing "
"the PSK using the HASH payload. It is recommended to keep this option to no, "
"unless the exact implications are known and compatibility is required for "
"such devices (for example, some SonicWall boxes)."
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິບັດບາງຢ່າງສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ Main Mode ທີສາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ, ອາດຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາ PSKs ສໍາລັບ ID ທີ່ລະບຸສໍາລັບການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບ Aggressive Mode, ແລະມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພຄືກັນ: ຜູ້ໂຈມຕີແບບ passive ສາມາດດົມກິ່ນ Identity ທີ່ເຈລະຈາໄດ້, ແລະເລີ່ມບັງຄັບ brute PSK ໂດຍໃຊ້ HASH payload. ຂໍແນະນໍາໃຫ້ຮັກສາຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນ no, ເວັ້ນແຕ່ຜົນກະທົບທີ່ແນ່ນອນແມ່ນເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກແລະຕ້ອງການຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ສໍາລັບອຸປະກອນດັ່ງກ່າວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, ບາງກ່ອງ SonicWall)."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:427
msgid "Maximum IKEv1 Phase 2 Exchanges"
msgstr "ການແລກປ່ຽນ IKEv1 Phase 2 ສູງສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:432
msgid ""
"IKEv1 phase 2 rekeying for one VPN gateway can be initiated in parallel. By "
"default only 3 parallel rekeys are allowed. Undersized values can break VPN "
"connections with many phase 2 definitions. If unsure, set this value to "
"match the largest number of phase 2 entries on any phase 1."
msgstr ""
"ການ rekeying IKEv1 phase 2 ສໍາລັບໜຶ່ງ VPN gateway ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ຂະໜານກັນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ 3 parallel rekeys ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປສາມາດທໍາລາຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ VPN ທີ່ມີຄໍານິຍາມ phase 2 ຫຼາຍອັນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຈໍານວນລາຍການ phase 2 ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດໃນ phase 1 ໃດໆ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:439
msgid "Enable Maximum MSS"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Maximum MSS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:444
#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:453
msgid "Maximum MSS"
msgstr "Maximum MSS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:457
msgid ""
"Enable MSS clamping on TCP flows over VPN. This helps overcome problems with "
"PMTUD on IPsec VPN links. If left blank, the default value is 1400 bytes. "
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ MSS clamping ໃນ TCP flows ຜ່ານ VPN. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາກັບ PMTUD ໃນລິ້ງ IPsec VPN. ຖ້າປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1400 bytes."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:465
msgid "Enable Cisco Extensions"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Cisco Extensions"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:468
msgid ""
"Enable Unity Plugin which provides Cisco Extension support such as Split-"
"Include, Split-Exclude and Split-Dns."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Unity Plugin ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ການຮອງຮັບ Cisco Extension ເຊັ່ນ Split-Include, Split-Exclude ແລະ Split-Dns."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:472
msgid "Strict CRL Checking"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CRL ຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:475
msgid ""
"Check this to require availability of a fresh CRL for peer authentication "
"based on certificate signatures to succeed."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍອັນນີ້ເພື່ອຕ້ອງການຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງ CRL ສົດໆສຳລັບການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ peer ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ລາຍເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເພື່ອສຳເລັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:479
msgid "Make before Break"
msgstr "ສ້າງກ່ອນທຳລາຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:482
msgid ""
"Instead of a break-before-make scheme. Make-before-break uses overlapping "
"IKE and CHILD_SA during reauthentication by first recreating all new SAs "
"before deleting the old ones. This behavior can be beneficial to avoid "
"connectivity gaps during reauthentication, but requires support for "
"overlapping SAs by the peer."
msgstr ""
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໂຄງການ break-before-make. Make-before-break ໃຊ້ IKE ແລະ CHILD_SA ທີ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍການສ້າງ SAs ໃໝ່ທັງໝົດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົບ SAs ເກົ່າ. ພຶດຕິກໍານີ້ສາມາດເປັນປະໂຫຍດເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຊ່ອງຫວ່າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຄືນໃໝ່, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງການການຮອງຮັບ SAs ທີ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັນໂດຍ peer."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:488
msgid "Asynchronous Cryptography"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ Asynchronous"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:491
msgid ""
"Allow crypto(9) jobs to be dispatched multi-threaded to increase performance."
" Jobs are handled in the order they are received so that packets will be "
"reinjected in the correct order."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ວຽກ crypto(9) ຖືກສົ່ງແບບ multi-threaded ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ. ວຽກງານຈະຖືກຈັດການຕາມລໍາດັບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແພັກເກັດຖືກ reinjected ຕາມລໍາດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:494
msgid "Custom ports"
msgstr "ພອດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:497
msgid "IKE port"
msgstr "ພອດ IKE"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:501
msgid "Local UDP port for IKE (Default: 500)"
msgstr "ພອດ UDP ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ IKE (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 500)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:505
msgid "NAT-T port"
msgstr "ພອດ NAT-T"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:509
msgid "Local UDP port for NAT-T (Default: 4500)"
msgstr "ພອດ UDP ທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບ NAT-T (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 4500)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:514
msgid "Auto-exclude LAN address"
msgstr "ບໍ່ລວມທີ່ຢູ່ LAN ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:517
msgid "Exclude traffic from LAN subnet to LAN IP address from IPsec."
msgstr "ບໍ່ລວມການຈະລາຈອນຈາກ LAN subnet ໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ IP LAN ຈາກ IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:521
msgid "Additional IPsec bypass"
msgstr "ການຂ້າມຜ່ານ IPsec ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:524
msgid "Create extra rules to exclude specific traffic from IPsec."
msgstr "ສ້າງກົດລະບຽບເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອບໍ່ລວມການຈະລາຈອນສະເພາະຈາກ IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:528
msgid "IPsec bypass rules"
msgstr "ກົດລະບຽບການຂ້າມຜ່ານ IPsec"

#: src/usr/local/www/graph_cpu.php:78
msgid "Cannot get CPU load"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບການໂຫຼດ CPU ໄດ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:88
#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:353
msgid "Reset Log Files"
msgstr "ຣີເຊັດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:90
msgid "The log files have been reset."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກໄດ້ຖືກຣີເຊັດແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:97
msgid ""
"A valid IP address/hostname or IP/hostname:port must be specified for remote "
"syslog server #1."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP/ຊື່ໂຮດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື IP/ຊື່ໂຮດ:ພອດສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດ #1."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:100
msgid ""
"A valid IP address/hostname or IP/hostname:port must be specified for remote "
"syslog server #2."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP/ຊື່ໂຮດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື IP/ຊື່ໂຮດ:ພອດສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດ #2."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:103
msgid ""
"A valid IP address/hostname or IP/hostname:port must be specified for remote "
"syslog server #3."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP/ຊື່ໂຮດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື IP/ຊື່ໂຮດ:ພອດສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດ #3."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:107
msgid "Number of log entries to show must be between 5 and 200000."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການບັນທຶກທີ່ຈະສະແດງຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 5 ຫາ 200000."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:126
msgid "Invalid Log Message Format."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:130
msgid "Invalid log compression type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການບີບອັດບັນທຶກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:207
msgid "Changed system logging options."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກລະບົບແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:235
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This field controls the size at which logs will be rotated. By default this "
"is %s per log file, and there are nearly 20 such log files."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດທີ່ບັນທຶກຈະຖືກໝຸນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ແມ່ນ %s ຕໍ່ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ, ແລະມີໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກດັ່ງກ່າວເກືອບ 20 ໄຟລ໌."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:237
msgid ""
"NOTE: Increasing this value allows every log file to grow to the specified "
"size, so disk usage may increase significantly."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທຸກໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂະຫຍາຍໄປສູ່ຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການໃຊ້ດິດອາດຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:238
msgid ""
"Log file sizes are checked once per minute to determine if rotation is "
"necessary, so a very rapidly growing log file may exceed this value."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຖືກກວດສອບໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ນາທີເພື່ອພິຈາລະນາວ່າການໝຸນແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນຫຼືບໍ່, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍຕົວໄວຫຼາຍອາດຈະເກີນຄ່ານີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:239
msgid "Disk space currently used by log files is: "
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ດິດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກແມ່ນ:"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:240
msgid " Remaining disk space for log files: "
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ດິດທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ:"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:242
msgid ""
"This option will allow the logging daemon to bind to a single IP address, "
"rather than all IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ daemon ການບັນທຶກຜູກກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວ, ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທັງໝົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:243
msgid ""
"If a single IP is picked, remote syslog servers must all be of that IP type. "
"To mix IPv4 and IPv6 remote syslog servers, bind to all interfaces."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເລືອກ IP ດຽວ, ເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດທັງໝົດຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດ IP ນັ້ນ. ເພື່ອປະສົມເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6, ໃຫ້ຜູກກັບທຸກອິນເຕີເຟດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:245
msgid ""
"NOTE: If an IP address cannot be located on the chosen interface, the daemon "
"will bind to all addresses."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ຖ້າທີ່ຢູ່ IP ບໍ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້ໃນອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ເລືອກ, daemon ຈະຜູກກັບທຸກທີ່ຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:263
msgid "General Logging Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກທົ່ວໄປ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:267
msgid "Log Message Format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:270
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The format of syslog messages written to disk locally and sent to remote "
"syslog servers (if enabled).%sChanging this value will only affect new log "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ syslog ທີ່ຂຽນໃສ່ດິດໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນແລະສົ່ງໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ syslog ຣີໂໝດ (ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້).%sການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນກະທົບພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:287
msgid ""
"This is only the number of log entries displayed in the GUI. It does not "
"affect how many entries are contained in the actual log files."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ຈຳນວນລາຍການບັນທຶກທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ GUI. ມັນບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຕົວຈິງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Log packets that are %1$sblocked%2$s by the implicit default block rule. - "
"Per-rule logging options are still respected."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກ %1$sບລັອກ%2$s ໂດຍກົດລະບຽບການບລັອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. - ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຕໍ່ກົດລະບຽບຍັງຄົງຖືກເຄົາລົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:301
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Log packets that are %1$sallowed%2$s by the implicit default pass rule. - "
"Per-rule logging options are still respected. "
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກ %1$sອະນຸຍາດ%2$s ໂດຍກົດລະບຽບການຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. - ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຕໍ່ກົດລະບຽບຍັງຄົງຖືກເຄົາລົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:322
msgid ""
"If this is checked, errors from the web server process for the GUI or "
"Captive Portal will appear in the main system log."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າອັນນີ້ຖືກໝາຍ, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກຂະບວນການເວັບເຊີບເວີສຳລັບ GUI ຫຼື Captive Portal ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນບັນທຶກລະບົບຫຼັກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:326
msgid "Raw Logs"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກດິບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:329
msgid ""
"If this is checked, filter logs are shown as generated by the packet filter, "
"without any formatting. This will reveal more detailed information, but it "
"is more difficult to read."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າອັນນີ້ຖືກໝາຍ, ບັນທຶກຕົວກອງຈະຖືກສະແດງຕາມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຕົວກອງແພັກເກັດ, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຈັດຮູບແບບໃດໆ. ນີ້ຈະເປີດເຜີຍຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແຕ່ມັນຍາກກວ່າທີ່ຈະອ່ານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:346
msgid "Local Logging"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກທ້ອງຖິ່ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:356
msgid ""
"Clears all local log files and reinitializes them as empty logs. This also "
"restarts the DHCP daemon. Use the Save button first if any setting changes "
"have been made."
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທ້ອງຖິ່ນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ເປັນບັນທຶກຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ນີ້ຍັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ daemon DHCP ຄືນໃໝ່. ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມບັນທຶກກ່ອນຖ້າมีการປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໆ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:359
msgid "Log Rotation Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການໝຸນບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:371
msgid "Log Compression"
msgstr "ການບີບອັດບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:374
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The type of compression to use when rotating log files. Compressing rotated "
"log files saves disk space, and the compressed logs remain available for "
"display and searching in the GUI.%s WARNING: Changing this value will remove "
"previously rotated compressed log files!"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການບີບອັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອໝຸນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ. ການບີບອັດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ໝຸນແລ້ວຊ່ວຍປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ດິດ, ແລະບັນທຶກທີ່ບີບອັດຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ສະແດງແລະຊອກຫາໃນ GUI.%s ຄຳເຕືອນ: ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຈະລົບບັນທຶກທີ່ບີບອັດທີ່ໝຸນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້!"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:387
msgid "Remote Logging Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຣີໂໝດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:392
msgid "Enable Remote Logging"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການບັນທຶກຣີໂໝດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:401
msgid "Default (any)"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ໃດໆ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:409
msgid ""
"This option is only used when a non-default address is chosen as the source "
"above. This option only expresses a preference; If an IP address of the "
"selected type is not found on the chosen interface, the other type will be "
"tried."
msgstr ""
