msgid "Mask"
msgstr "ມາສ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4412
msgid "If \"source\" or \"destination\" slots is chosen a dynamic pipe with the bandwidth, delay, packet loss and queue size given above will be created for each source/destination IP address encountered, respectively. This makes it possible to easily specify bandwidth limits per host or subnet."
msgstr "ຖ້າ \"source\" ຫຼື \"destination\" slots ເຖິງຖືກເລືອກແຕ່ລະ IP ທີ່ທຳອິດ, ທໍ່ dynamic ທີ່ມີ bandwidth, delay, packet loss ແລະຂະໜາດຄິວທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງນີ້ຈະເປັນໃບສະບຽງຂອງເປົ້າຫມາຍແຕ່ລະ IP. ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດລະບຸ bandwidth limits ຂອງໂຮສຕ໌ຫຼື subnet."

