#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_pps.php:149
msgid "Devices with a Pulse Per Second output such as radios that receive a time signal from DCF77 (DE), JJY (JP), MSF (GB) or WWVB (US) may be used as a PPS reference for NTP. A serial GPS may also be used, but the serial GPS driver would usually be the better option. A PPS signal only provides a reference to the change of a second, so at least one other source to number the seconds is required.<br /><br />At least 3 additional time sources should be configured under <a href=\"services_ntpd.php\">Services > NTP > Settings</a> to reliably supply the time of each PPS pulse."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງຊ່ວຍຊີພາບທີ່ມີ Pulse Per Second (PPS) output ເຊັ່ນວິທະຍຸທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍານເວລາຈາກ DCF77 (DE), JJY (JP), MSF (GB) ຫຼື WWVB (US) ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເປັນ PPS reference ສຳຫຼັບ NTP. GPS ຫນ້າວໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເປັນ series ອາດຈະໄດ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນວ່າ driver GPS series ຄືກັບເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີກວ່າ. ສັນຍານ PPS ເພີດປຽບລະບົບທີ່ເປັນປຽບຂອງປ່ຽນເວລາຫນຶ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ຄົນ, ສະຫນັບສະຫນູນວ່າອີກຢ່າງຫນື່ງເພື່ອເລກໄວ້ນຶ່ງ. <br /><br />ຢ່າງນ້ອຍໆທັງຫມົດຄືຫລາຍຫນ້ານທີ່ຄວນຈະໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ໃຕ້ <a href=\"services_ntpd.php\">Services > NTP > Settings</a> ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງແທ້ທີ່ຖືກເວລາສະໜອງແຕ່ລະຂອງປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ປຽບ."

