#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:488
msgid "Use 0x-20 encoded random bits in the DNS query to foil spoofing attempts."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ບິດທີ່ສຸ່ມໄດ້ເປັນ 0x-20 ໃນຄໍາຮ້ອງ DNS ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຫຼອກລວງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:495
msgid "Enable DNS64 (RFC 6147)"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການ DNS64 (RFC 6147)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:207
msgid "ECN friendly behavior violates RFC2893. This should be used in mutual agreement with the peer."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິການຂອງ ECN ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮ່າງສິນເຫັນດ້ວຍ RFC2893. ນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນການເຫັນດ້ວຍໂດຍທາງຄູ່ສົນທິທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:214
msgid "Disable automatic filtering of the outer GIF source which ensures a match with the configured remote peer. When disabled, martian and inbound filtering is not performed which allows asymmetric routing of the outer traffic."
msgstr "ປິດການກອງແບບອັດໂຕໂນມັດຂອງແຫຼ່ງ GIF ທາງນອກທີ່ປ້ອງກັນການເຂົ້າກັບຄູ່ຄືນທີ່ຖືກຄອບ. ເມື່ອປິດ, ການກອງເຂົ້າມາແລະ martian ບໍ່ຖືກປະຕິບັດ ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດການເສີບທິດທາງຂອງການຂົນສົ່ງຂອງແຫຼ່ງທາງນອກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_acls.php:205
msgid "Enable KOD packets."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ການ packet KOD."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_acls.php:212
msgid "Deny run-time Configuration (nomodify) by ntpq and ntpdc."
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ runtime (nomodify) ໂດຍ ntpq ແລະ ntpdc."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_acls.php:219
msgid "Disable ntpq and ntpdc queries (noquery)."
msgstr "ປິດການ query ຂອງ ntpq ແລະ ntpdc (noquery)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_acls.php:226
msgid "Disable all except ntpq and ntpdc queries (noserve)."
msgstr "ປິດທຸກຢ່າງເວັນຈາກ query ຂອງ ntpq ແລະ ntpdc (noserve)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_acls.php:233
msgid "Deny packets that attempt a peer association (nopeer)."
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດ packet ທີ່ພະຍາຍາມການສຳພັນ peer (nopeer)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_acls.php:240
