msgid ""
"Make Windows 10 Clients Block access to DNS servers except across OpenVPN "
"while connected, forcing clients to use only VPN DNS servers."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າ Windows 10 ປົກກອດການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີ DNS ເວັນຈາກການເຊື່ອມ OpenVPN ໃນເວລາທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ບອກລູກຄ້າໃຊ້ເຊີເວີ DNS ຂອງ VPN ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1477
msgid ""
"Run \"net stop dnscache\", \"net start dnscache\", \"ipconfig /flushdns\" "
"and \"ipconfig /registerdns\" on connection initiation."
msgstr "ລະດູໃຊ້ \"net stop dnscache\", \"net start dnscache\", \"ipconfig /flushdns\" ແລະ \"ipconfig /registerdns\" ໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1565
